using Macaulay2 with Emacs
**************************

Emacs is a free text editor which can be used as an ASCII-oriented interface to
Macaulay2. The best way to edit Macaulay2 code or to run Macaulay2 is with
Emacs or its MacOS variant Aquamacs. Emacs is available as part of many
operating systems, as well as from https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/.

