apropos -- symbols matching a pattern
*************************************

  * Usage: 
        apropos pattern
  * Inputs:
      * pattern, a *note string: String,, a regular expression pattern to match
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: List,, of global symbols matching the given pattern

Description
===========

In the simplest case, the list of symbols containing the given string is
returned.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : apropos "atrix"                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = {blockMatrixForm, ChangeMatrix, compactMatrixForm, diagonalMatrix,      |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     fillMatrix, genericMatrix, genericSkewMatrix, genericSymmetricMatrix,   |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     getChangeMatrix, Matrix, matrix, MatrixExpression, MinimalMatrix,       |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     MutableMatrix, mutableMatrix, randomMutableMatrix, submatrix,           |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     submatrix', submatrixByDegrees, sylvesterMatrix, SyzygyMatrix,          |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     vertexEdgeMatrix, vertexFacetMatrix}                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

*note Regular expressions: regular expressions, allow for more complicated
requests. For example, to find all functions that start with mat or Mat:

+------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : apropos "^[mM]at"                                |
|                                                      |
|o2 = {match, mathML, Matrix, matrix, MatrixExpression}|
|                                                      |
|o2 : List                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------+

It is also possible to view a table of headlines corresponding to the results.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : headlines apropos "hilbert"                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = 0.  "Polyhedra :: hilbertBasis"           --                            |
|     1.  "Macaulay2Doc :: hilbertFunction"     --                            |
|     2.  "Macaulay2Doc :: hilbertPolynomial"   --                            |
|     3.  "Macaulay2Doc :: hilbertSeries"       --                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|computes the Hilbert basis of a Cone                                         |
|the Hilbert function                                                         |
|compute the Hilbert polynomial                                               |
|compute the Hilbert series                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

