========

  * *note viewHelp: viewHelp, -- view online documentation in a web browser
  * *note help: help, -- view documentation nodes
  * *note about: about, -- search the documentation
  * *note apropos: apropos, -- symbols matching a pattern

Ways to use infoHelp:
=====================

  * "infoHelp"
  * "infoHelp(ZZ)" -- see *note headlines: headlines, -- display a table of
    documentation headlines
  * "infoHelp(DocumentTag)"
  * "infoHelp(Thing)"

For the programmer
==================

The object *note infoHelp: infoHelp, is a *note command: Command,.

