getting help or reporting bugs
******************************

If you notice something that seems like a bug or a mistake in the
documentation, please reach out through one of the following channels. You can
also ask for help with using Macaulay2 in your research or find ways to
contribute to Macaulay2.

  * GitHub Issues (see https://github.com/Macaulay2/M2/issues ) -- for
    reporting bugs and requesting features
  * Zulip server (see https://macaulay2.zulipchat.com ) -- for online
    collaboration and discussions
  * Google Group (see https://groups.google.com/group/macaulay2 ) -- for
    announcements and general questions
