demark -- insert a string between elements of a list of strings
***************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        demark(d, L)
  * Inputs:
      * d, a *note string: String,, 
      * L, a *note list: List,, of strings
  * Outputs:
      * s, a *note string: String,, the string obtained by concatenating the
        elements of L, with copies of the string d inserted between each pair

Description
===========

+------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : demark("+", a..f)                                |
|                                                      |
|o1 = a+b+c+d+e+f                                      |
+------------------------------------------------------+
