pad -- pad a string or net with spaces
**************************************

  * Usage: 
        pad(s,n)
        pad(n,s)
  * Inputs:
      * s, a *note net: Net,, 
      * n, an *note integer: ZZ,, 

Description
===========

pad(s,n) pads the string or net s to length n with spaces on the right.

pad(n,s) pads the string or net s to length n with spaces on the left.

+--------------------------+
|i1 : pad(6, "foo")        |
|                          |
|o1 =    foo               |
+--------------------------+
|i2 : pad("foo", 6) | "bar"|
|                          |
|o2 = foo   bar            |
+--------------------------+

Ways to use pad:
================

  * "pad(Net,ZZ)"
  * "pad(String,ZZ)"
  * "pad(ZZ,Net)"
  * "pad(ZZ,String)"

For the programmer
==================

The object *note pad: pad, is a *note method function: MethodFunction,.

