net(String) -- convert a string to a net
****************************************

  * Function: *note net: net,
  * Usage: 
        net s
  * Inputs:
      * s, a *note string: String,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note net: Net,, formed by stacking the lines of the string s
        vertically

Description
===========

Tab characters are converted to spaces, with a tab stop at every 8-th column.

In the following examples we can use peek to see the exact shape of the nets
produced.

+-----------------------------------+
|i1 : net "line 1\nline 2\nline 3\n"|
|                                   |
|o1 = line 1                        |
|     line 2                        |
|     line 3                        |
+-----------------------------------+
|i2 : peek oo                       |
|                                   |
|     +------+                      |
|o2 = |line 1|                      |
|     |line 2|                      |
|     |line 3|                      |
|     |      |                      |
|     +------+                      |
+-----------------------------------+
|i3 : net ""                        |
|                                   |
|o3 =                               |
+-----------------------------------+
|i4 : peek oo                       |
|                                   |
|     ++                            |
|o4 = ||                            |
|     ++                            |
+-----------------------------------+
|i5 : net "\n"                      |
|                                   |
|o5 =                               |
+-----------------------------------+
|i6 : peek oo                       |
|                                   |
|     ++                            |
|o6 = ||                            |
|     ||                            |
|     ++                            |
+-----------------------------------+
|i7 : net "\n\n\ta"                 |
|                                   |
|o7 =                               |
|                                   |
|             a                     |
+-----------------------------------+
|i8 : peek oo                       |
