FilePosition -- the class of all file positions
***********************************************

Description
===========

FilePosition -- a type of list designed to represent a position in a file.


It's implemented as a list with 3, 5 or 7 elements. The first part is the file
name, then each pair is a row/column position. A single pair is a position, two
form a range. The last pair is the central point of interest in that range.

