quotientRemainder(RingElement,RingElement) -- quotient and remainder
********************************************************************

  * Function: *note quotientRemainder: quotientRemainder,
  * Usage: 
        (q,r) = quotientRemainder(f,g)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note ring element: RingElement,
      * g, a *note ring element: RingElement,
  * Outputs:
      * q, a *note ring element: RingElement,, the quotient for the division of
        f by g
      * r, a *note ring element: RingElement,, the remainder for the division
        of f by g

Description
===========

+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y];                                                  |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : (q,r) = quotientRemainder(x^10+5,x-2);                        |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : q                                                             |
|                                                                   |
|      9     8     7     6      5      4      3       2             |
|o3 = x  + 2x  + 4x  + 8x  + 16x  + 32x  + 64x  + 128x  + 256x + 512|
|                                                                   |
|o3 : R                                                             |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : r                                                             |
|                                                                   |
|o4 = 1029                                                          |
|                                                                   |
|o4 : R                                                             |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : q*(x-2)+r                                                     |
|                                                                   |
|      10                                                           |
|o5 = x   + 5                                                       |
|                                                                   |
|o5 : R                                                             |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+

