RingElement .. RingElement -- a sequence of consecutive generators of a polynomial ring
***************************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note ..: _pd_pd,
  * Usage: 
        s .. t
  * Inputs:
      * s, a *note ring element: RingElement,
      * t, a *note ring element: RingElement,
  * Outputs:
      * the sequence of consecutive generators of a polynomial ring, from s to
        t, inclusive

Description
===========

+----------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a..z]                 |
|                                  |
|o1 = R                            |
|                                  |
|o1 : PolynomialRing               |
+----------------------------------+
|i2 : b .. i                       |
|                                  |
|o2 = (b, c, d, e, f, g, h, i)     |
|                                  |
|o2 : Sequence                     |
+----------------------------------+
|i3 : plus oo                      |
|                                  |
|o3 = b + c + d + e + f + g + h + i|
|                                  |
|o3 : R                            |
+----------------------------------+

Warning: former behavior involved making the names of the generators
consecutive, so the results in the next example differ from those given before.

+--------------------------------+
|i4 : R = QQ[e,d,c,b,a,X_1,y,X_2]|
|                                |
|o4 = R                          |
|                                |
|o4 : PolynomialRing             |
+--------------------------------+
|i5 : e .. a                     |
|                                |
|o5 = ()                         |
|                                |
|o5 : Sequence                   |
+--------------------------------+
|i6 : X_1 .. X_2                 |
|                                |
|o6 = (X , X )                   |
|       1   2                    |
|                                |
|o6 : Sequence                   |
+--------------------------------+

Warning: since former behavior involved only the names of the generators, there
was no requirement that s and t be in the same ring, whereas now there is.

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note RingElement .. RingElement: RingElement _pd_pd RingElement, -- a
    sequence of consecutive generators of a polynomial ring
