File: Macaulay2Doc.info, Node: Option, Next: Vector, Prev: RingElement, Up: BasicList

Option -- the class of all key-value pairs K => V
*************************************************

Description
===========

Such pairs are used as optional arguments for functions.

+---------------------+
|i1 : o = Limit => 5  |
|                     |
|o1 = Limit => 5      |
|                     |
|o1 : Option          |
+---------------------+
|i2 : peek o          |
|                     |
|o2 = Option{Limit, 5}|
+---------------------+

There is also a way to make new *note hash tables: HashTable, from lists of
key-value pairs.

+---------------------------------------------+
|i3 : ht = new HashTable from {a => 5, b => 7}|
|                                             |
|o3 = HashTable{a => 5}                       |
|               b => 7                        |
|                                             |
|o3 : HashTable                               |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i4 : keys ht                                 |
|                                             |
|o4 = {a, b}                                  |
|                                             |
|o4 : List                                    |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i5 : values ht                               |
|                                             |
|o5 = {5, 7}                                  |
|                                             |
|o5 : List                                    |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i6 : pairs ht                                |
|                                             |
|o6 = {(a, 5), (b, 7)}                        |
|                                             |
|o6 : List                                    |
+---------------------------------------------+

These pairs are implemented as lists, so that if z is x => y, then x is z#0 and
y is z#1.

+-----------+
|i7 : o#0   |
|           |
|o7 = Limit |
|           |
|o7 : Symbol|
+-----------+
|i8 : o#1   |
|           |
|o8 = 5     |
+-----------+

See also
========

  * *note new HashTable from List: new HashTable from List, -- make a hash
    table from a list
  * *note Thing => Thing: =>, -- construct an option
* Menu:

* options::                     get options

Functions and methods returning an option:
==========================================

  * "Thing => Thing" -- see *note =>: =>, -- construct an option

