|i4 : value e                        |
|                                    |
|      5     4      3      2         |
|o4 = x  + 5x  + 10x  + 10x  + 5x + 1|
|                                    |
|o4 : QQ[x]                          |
+------------------------------------+
|i5 : value e == f                   |
|                                    |
|o5 = true                           |
+------------------------------------+
|i6 : c = factor f                   |
|                                    |
|            5                       |
|o6 = (x + 1)                        |
|                                    |
|o6 : Expression of class Product    |
+------------------------------------+
|i7 : value c                        |
|                                    |
|      5     4      3      2         |
