VisibleList -- the class of all visible lists
*********************************************

Description
===========

There are three types of lists that can be entered directly from the keyboard,
as follows.
+--------------+
|i1 : {a,b,c}  |
|              |
|o1 = {a, b, c}|
|              |
|o1 : List     |
+--------------+
|i2 : [a,b,c]  |
|              |
|o2 = [a, b, c]|
|              |
|o2 : Array    |
+--------------+
|i3 : (a,b,c)  |
|              |
|o3 = (a, b, c)|
|              |
|o3 : Sequence |
+--------------+
We introduce the class of visible lists as a convenience for referring to lists
of these types.
* Menu:

* List::                        the class of all lists -- {...}
