File: Macaulay2Doc.info, Node: VerticalList, Up: List

VerticalList -- a type of visible self-initializing list that prints vertically
*******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        VerticalList x
  * Inputs:
      * x, a *note list: List,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note vertical list: VerticalList,

Description
===========

All operations on lists apply to vertical lists, since they inherit from the
type *note VisibleList: VisibleList,.  The only difference is the way that a
vertical list is displayed vertically.
