|                |
|o2 = 3          |
+----------------+
|i3 : v#2        |
|                |
|o3 = c          |
|                |
|o3 : Symbol     |
+----------------+

To convert sequences to and from other types of *note BasicList: BasicList,, in
addition to *note toSequence: toSequence,, one may use *note new: new,.

+------------------------------+
|i4 : new Array from (a,b,c)   |
|                              |
|o4 = [a, b, c]                |
|                              |
|o4 : Array                    |
+------------------------------+
|i5 : new Sequence from [a,b,c]|
|                              |
|o5 = (a, b, c)                |
|                              |
|o5 : Sequence                 |
