Bag -- the class of all bags
****************************

Description
===========

A bag can be used for enclosing something in a container to prevent it from
being printed, in normal circumstances. Any mutable list can be used for this
purpose, but bags are designed for this purpose.  In comparison and sorting,
they are declared to be incomparable.

* Menu:

