ZZ : Thing -- repeat an item
****************************

  * Operator: *note _colon_: _co,

Description
===========

n : x repetition n times of x in a sequence


If n is an integer and x is anything, return a sequence consisting of x
repeated n times.  A negative value for n will silently be treated as zero.


Warning: such sequences do not get automatically spliced into lists containing
them.


+------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : {5:a,10:b}                                       |
|                                                      |
|o1 = {(a, a, a, a, a), (b, b, b, b, b, b, b, b, b, b)}|
|                                                      |
|o1 : List                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : splice {5:a,10:b}                                |
|                                                      |
|o2 = {a, a, a, a, a, b, b, b, b, b, b, b, b, b, b}    |
|                                                      |
|o2 : List                                             |
+------------------------------------------------------+

