apply(Thing,Function) -- apply a function to an object with an iterator
***********************************************************************

  * Function: *note apply: apply,
  * Usage: 
        apply(x, f)
  * Inputs:
      * x, a *note thing: Thing,, an instance of a class with the *note
        iterator: iterator, method installed;
      * f, a *note function: Function,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an *note iterator: Iterator,, 

Description
===========

Suppose x is an instance of a class with the *note iterator: iterator, method
installed and suppose iter is the output of iterator x.  Then a new *note
Iterator: Iterator, object is returned whose *note next: next, method returns f
next iter  until next iter returns *note StopIteration: StopIteration,, in
which case this new iterator does the same.

+-----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : applyiter = apply(iterator "foo", toUpper)|
|                                               |
|o1 = applyiter                                 |
|                                               |
|o1 : Iterator                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : next applyiter                            |
|                                               |
|o2 = F                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i3 : next applyiter                            |
|                                               |
|o3 = O                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i4 : next applyiter                            |
|                                               |
|o4 = O                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i5 : next applyiter                            |
|                                               |
|o5 = StopIteration                             |
|                                               |
|o5 : Symbol                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------+

