isTable -- whether something is a list of lists of equal length
***************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        isTable t
  * Inputs:
      * t, a *note thing: Thing,, 
  * Outputs:
      * b, a *note Boolean value: Boolean,, whether or not $t$ is a table

Description
===========

+------------------------------+
|i1 : isTable {{1,2,3},{4,5,6}}|
|                              |
|o1 = true                     |
+------------------------------+
|i2 : isTable {{1,2,3},{4,5}}  |
|                              |
|o2 = false                    |
+------------------------------+

Caveat
======

It is intrinsically impossible to represent a $0\times k$ matrix as a list of
lists.

