subtable -- extract a subtable from a table
*******************************************

  * Usage: 
        subtable(a, b, T)
  * Inputs:
      * a, a *note list: List,, of rows to extract
      * b, a *note list: List,, of columns to extract
  * Outputs:
      * S, the subtable of $T$ defined by restricting to rows in the list $a$
        and columns in the list $b$

Description
===========

+---------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : t = table({1,3,5,7}, {0,1,2,4}, (i,j) -> i^j);|
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : netList t                                     |
|                                                   |
|     +-+-+--+----+                                 |
|o2 = |1|1|1 |1   |                                 |
|     +-+-+--+----+                                 |
|     |1|3|9 |81  |                                 |
|     +-+-+--+----+                                 |
|     |1|5|25|625 |                                 |
|     +-+-+--+----+                                 |
|     |1|7|49|2401|                                 |
|     +-+-+--+----+                                 |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : s1 = subtable({0,2}, {1,3}, t);               |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : netList s1                                    |
|                                                   |
|     +-+---+                                       |
|o4 = |1|1  |                                       |
|     +-+---+                                       |
|     |5|625|                                       |
|     +-+---+                                       |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : s2 = subtable(toList(0..3), {1}, t);          |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : netList s2                                    |
|                                                   |
|     +-+                                           |
|o6 = |1|                                           |
|     +-+                                           |
|     |3|                                           |
|     +-+                                           |
|     |5|                                           |
|     +-+                                           |
|     |7|                                           |
|     +-+                                           |
+---------------------------------------------------+

