  * *note insert: insert, -- copy a list, inserting an element
  * *note join: join, -- join lists, sequences, and iterable objects
  * *note pack: pack, -- pack elements of a list or string into several shorter
    lists or strings
  * *note sort: sort, -- sort a list or columns of a matrix
  * *note sublists: sublists, -- process interspersed subsequences of a visible
    list
  * *note lists and sequences: lists and sequences, -- a detailed overview of
    lists and sequences in Macaulay2

