tally -- tally the elements of a list, sequence, array, or string
*****************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        y = tally x
  * Inputs:
      * x, a *note visible list: VisibleList, or a *note string: String,, 
  * Outputs:
      * y, a *note tally: Tally,, 

Description
===========

It produces a hash table (multiset) y which tallies the frequencies of the
occurrences of items in the list or string x, i.e., y_i is the number of times
i appears in x, or is 0 if i doesn't appear in the list or string.

+--------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : y = tally {1,2,3,a,b,1,2,a,1,2,{a,b},{a,b},a}|
|                                                  |
|o1 = Tally{{a, b} => 2}                           |
|           1 => 3                                 |
|           2 => 3                                 |
|           3 => 1                                 |
|           a => 3                                 |
|           b => 1                                 |
|                                                  |
|o1 : Tally                                        |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : y_2                                          |
|                                                  |
|o2 = 3                                            |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : y_5                                          |
|                                                  |
|o3 = 0                                            |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : y_{a,b}                                      |
|                                                  |
|o4 = 2                                            |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : tally "Hello, world!"                        |
|                                                  |
|o5 = Tally{  => 1}                                |
|           ! => 1                                 |
|           , => 1                                 |
|           d => 1                                 |
|           e => 1                                 |
|           H => 1                                 |
|           l => 3                                 |
|           o => 2                                 |
|           r => 1                                 |
|           w => 1                                 |
|                                                  |
|o5 : Tally                                        |
+--------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note Tally: Tally, -- the class of all tally results

