|i2 : scanKeys(t, print)                       |
|1                                             |
|2                                             |
|3                                             |
|4                                             |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i3 : scanKeys(t, k -> if k>2 then print t#k)  |
|4                                             |
|20                                            |
+----------------------------------------------+

Caveat
======

This function requires an immutable hash table.  To scan the keys in a mutable
hash table, use scan(keys t, f).

