. -- access to elements whose key is a symbol
*********************************************

Description
===========

x.k -- the same as x#(global k), i.e., treat k as a global symbol and provide
the value stored in the hash table x under the key k.


May also be used in an assignment.


+-------------------------------+
|i1 : x = new MutableHashTable; |
+-------------------------------+
|i2 : x.k = 444                 |
|                               |
|o2 = 444                       |
+-------------------------------+
|i3 : x.k                       |
|                               |
|o3 = 444                       |
+-------------------------------+
|i4 : peek x                    |
|                               |
|o4 = MutableHashTable{k => 444}|
+-------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note #: #, -- length or access to elements
  * *note .?: _pd?, -- check for presence of elements whose key is a symbol
  * *note global: global, -- get a global symbol

