if -- condition testing
***********************

Description
===========

if p then x else y computes p, which must yield the value *note true: true, or
*note false: false,.  If true, then the value of x is provided, else the value
of y is provided.


if p then x computes p, which must yield the value *note true: true, or *note
false: false,.  If true, then the value of x is provided, else *note null:
null, is provided.

For the programmer
==================

The object *note if: if, is a *note keyword: Keyword,.

