break -- break from a loop
**************************

  * Usage: 
        break x
  * Consequences:
      * this interrupts execution of a loop controlled by *note for: for,,
        *note while: while,, *note apply: apply,, or *note scan: scan,,
        returning x as the value of the loop currently being evaluated.
      * Alternatively, as a top level command in the debugger, it leaves the
        debugger, returning the user to top level.

Description
===========

Omitting x, and executing break, interrupts execution of a loop as above,
returning *note null: null, as the value of the function currently being
evaluated, except, in the case of a *note for: for, loop or a *note while:
while, loop with a list clause, the list accumulated so far is returned as the
value.

+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : for i from 1 to 10 do if i == 7 then break 12345|
|                                                     |
|o1 = 12345                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------+

Warning: trying to break from a loop controlled by *note table: table, will
probably not do what you expect, since *note table: table, is implemented by
two nested loops controlled by *note apply: apply,, and only the inner one will
stop, as in the following example.

+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : table(3,3,(i,j) -> if i == 1 then break 3 else "hi")|
|                                                         |
|o2 = {{hi, hi, hi}, 3, {hi, hi, hi}}                     |
|                                                         |
|o2 : List                                                |
+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : table(3,3,(i,j) -> if j == 1 then break 3 else "hi")|
|                                                         |
|o3 = {3, 3, 3}                                           |
|                                                         |
|o3 : List                                                |
+---------------------------------------------------------+

Here is an example as a debugger command.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : load "Macaulay2Doc/demos/demo1.m2"                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : g 2                                                                     |
|/usr/local/share/Macaulay2/Macaulay2Doc/demos/demo1.m2:8:11:(3):[3]: error   |
|/usr/local/share/Macaulay2/Macaulay2Doc/demos/demo1.m2:8:11:(3): entering    |
|/usr/local/share/Macaulay2/Macaulay2Doc/demos/demo1.m2:8:                    |
|10-8:13: --source code:                                                      |
|     b := 1/x;                                                               |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|: division by zero                                                           |
|debugger (enter 'help' to see commands)                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|ii6 : x                                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|oo6 = 0                                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|ii7 : break                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : g 3                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|     7                                                                       |
|o8 = -                                                                       |
|     2                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : QQ                                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

