debug(LocalDictionary) -- open a local or global dictionary to the user
***********************************************************************

  * Function: *note debug: debug,
  * Usage: 
        debug dict
  * Inputs:
      * dict, an instance of the type *note LocalDictionary: LocalDictionary,
        or an instance of the type *note GlobalDictionary: GlobalDictionary,,
