|                              |
|o4 = g                        |
|                              |
|o4 : FunctionClosure          |
+------------------------------+
|i5 : g()                      |
|                              |
|o5 = 16                       |
+------------------------------+
Tail recursion optimization may be in effect, so there the answer may not
always be what you expect.
