|i1 : s = factor 112                   |
|                                      |
|      4                               |
|o1 = 2 7                              |
|                                      |
|o1 : Expression of class Product      |
+--------------------------------------+
|i2 : peek s                           |
|                                      |
|              4                       |
|o2 = Product{2 , 7}                   |
+--------------------------------------+
|i3 : peek'_2 s                        |
|                                      |
|o3 = Product{Power{2, 4}, Power{7, 1}}|
+--------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note peek: peek, -- examine contents of an object

Ways to use peek':
==================

  * "peek'(ZZ,Thing)"

