Package -- the class of all packages
************************************

Description
===========

See *note packages: packages, for an overview about using and writing Macaulay2
packages.



Available packages:

  * *note packages provided with Macaulay2: packages provided with Macaulay2,
  * The directory containing the packages is common/share/Macaulay2/ (see
    common/share/Macaulay2/ )
  * In addition, there are two meta-packages: *note Core: Core, and *note User:
    User,.

Functions useful when *note using packages: packages,:

  * *note needsPackage: needsPackage, -- load a package if not already loaded
  * *note loadPackage: loadPackage, -- load a package
  * *note installPackage: installPackage, -- load and install a package and its
    documentation
  * *note check: check, -- perform tests of a package
  * *note debug: debug, -- assistant for debugging packages, dictionaries, etc
  * *note importFrom: importFrom, -- import symbols to the current private
    dictionary

Functions useful when *note creating a package: creating a package,:

  * *note newPackage: newPackage, -- the preamble of a package
  * *note export: export, -- export symbols from a package
  * *note exportMutable: exportMutable, -- export mutable symbols from a
    package
  * *note beginDocumentation: beginDocumentation, -- start documentation
    section of a package
  * *note document: document, -- create a documentation node
  * *note TEST: TEST, -- add a test for a package

Functions useful when debugging a package:

  * *note debugging: debugging,
  * *note debug: debug, -- assistant for debugging packages, dictionaries, etc
  * *note check: check, -- perform tests of a package

Functions that are only rarely used:

  * *note use: use, -- install or activate object
  * *note dismiss: dismiss, -- dismiss a package
  * *note exportFrom: exportFrom, -- export symbols from a package's private
    dictionary
  * *note endPackage: endPackage, -- end a new package
  * *note readPackage: readPackage, -- read the package preamble
  * *note uninstallPackage: uninstallPackage, -- uninstall a package and remove
    its documentation
  * *note makePackageIndex: makePackageIndex, -- create an index of installed
    packages
  * *note loadedPackages: loadedPackages, -- the list of loaded packages

See also
========

  * *note packages: packages, -- Macaulay2 packages
  * *note creating a package: creating a package,
  * *note packageTemplate: (SimpleDoc)packageTemplate, -- a template for a
    package

Functions and methods returning a package:
==========================================

  * *note installPackage: installPackage, -- load and install a package and its
    documentation
  * *note loadPackage: loadPackage, -- load a package
  * *note needsPackage: needsPackage, -- load a package if not already loaded
  * *note package: package, -- get containing package

Methods that use a package:
===========================

  * "? Package" -- see *note ? Symbol: ? Symbol, -- view brief documentation of
    a symbol
  * "check(List,Package)" -- see *note check: check, -- perform tests of a
    package
  * "check(Package)" -- see *note check: check, -- perform tests of a package
  * "check(ZZ,Package)" -- see *note check: check, -- perform tests of a
    package
  * *note debug(Package): debug_lpPackage_rp, -- open the private dictionary of
    a package
  * "dismiss(Package)" -- see *note dismiss: dismiss, -- dismiss a package
  * "exportFrom(Package,List)" -- see *note exportFrom: exportFrom, -- export
    symbols from a package's private dictionary
  * "exportFrom(Package,String)" -- see *note exportFrom: exportFrom, -- export
    symbols from a package's private dictionary
  * "importFrom(Package,List)" -- see *note importFrom: importFrom, -- import
    symbols to the current private dictionary
  * "importFrom(Package,String)" -- see *note importFrom: importFrom, -- import
    symbols to the current private dictionary
  * "installPackage(Package)" -- see *note installPackage: installPackage, --
    load and install a package and its documentation
  * "loadPackage(Package)" -- see *note loadPackage: loadPackage, -- load a
    package
  * "locate(Package)" -- see *note locate: locate, -- locate source code
  * "methods(Package)" -- see *note methods: methods, -- list methods
  * *note options(Package): options_lpPackage_rp,
  * "package(Package)" -- see *note package: package, -- get containing package
  * "readPackage(Package)" -- see *note readPackage: readPackage, -- read the
    package preamble
  * "tests(Package)" -- see *note tests: tests, -- locate a package's tests
  * "tests(ZZ,Package)" -- see *note tests: tests, -- locate a package's tests
  * "uninstallPackage(Package)" -- see *note uninstallPackage:
    uninstallPackage, -- uninstall a package and remove its documentation
  * *note use(Package): use_lpPackage_rp, -- activate a previously dismissed
    package

Protected objects of class Package:
===================================

  * *note Core: Core, -- the core of Macaulay2
  * *note User: User, -- default package for interpreter interactions

For the programmer
==================

The object *note Package: Package, is a *note type: Type,, with ancestor
classes *note MutableHashTable: MutableHashTable, < *note HashTable: HashTable,
< *note Thing: Thing,.

