debug(Package) -- open the private dictionary of a package
**********************************************************

  * Function: *note debug: debug,
  * Usage: 
        debug pkg
  * Inputs:
      * pkg, a *note package: Package,, 
  * Consequences:
      * the private dictionary of the package pkg is added to *note
        dictionaryPath: dictionaryPath, so its non-exported symbols are visible
        to the user

