endPackage -- end a new package
*******************************

  * Usage: 
        endPackage pkgname
  * Inputs:
      * pkgname, a *note string: String,, the name of the package
  * Outputs:
      * a *note package: Package,, the new package
  * Consequences:
      * The package named should have been opened with *note newPackage:
        newPackage,. The package is closed, and the former value of *note
        dictionaryPath: dictionaryPath, is restored, with the global dictionary
        (containing the exported symbols) of the package prepended.

Description
===========

A package writer need not call this function explicitly, since the end of file
hook for the file containing the *note newPackage: newPackage, command that
opened the package will call *note endPackage: endPackage,.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : newPackage "Foo"                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = Foo                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : Package                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : export "abc"                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = {abc}                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : abc = 3                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = 3                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : dictionaryPath                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = {Foo#"private dictionary", Foo.Dictionary, Core.Dictionary,             |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     OutputDictionary, PackageDictionary}                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : endPackage "Foo"                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = Foo                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : Package                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : peek oo                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = Package{configuration file name => null                                 |
|             Dictionary => Foo.Dictionary                                    |
|             example data files => MutableHashTable{}                        |
|             example inputs => MutableHashTable{}                            |
|             example results => MutableHashTable{}                           |
|             exported mutable symbols => {}                                  |
|             exported symbols => {abc}                                       |
|             loadDepth => 3                                                  |
|             Options => OptionTable{Authors => {}                            |
|                                    AuxiliaryFiles => false                  |
|                                    CacheExampleOutput => null               |
|                                    Certification => null                    |
|                                    Configuration => {}                      |
|                                    Date => null                             |
|                                    DebuggingMode => false                   |
|                                    Headline => null                         |
|                                    HomePage => null                         |
|                                    InfoDirSection => Macaulay2 and its      |
|                                    Keywords => {Uncategorized}              |
|                                    OptionalComponentsPresent => true        |
|                                    PackageExports => {}                     |
|                                    PackageImports => {}                     |
|                                    Reload => false                          |
|                                    UseCachedExampleOutput => false          |
|                                    Version => 0.0                           |
|             package prefix => /usr/local/                                   |
|             PackageIsLoaded => true                                         |
|             pkgname => Foo                                                  |
|             private dictionary => Foo#"private dictionary"                  |
|             processed documentation => MutableHashTable{}                   |
|             raw documentation => MutableHashTable{}                         |
|             source directory => /tmp/M2-31115-0/98-rundir/                  |
|             source file => stdio                                            |
