|o2 = <mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup>                                 |
|     <mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mspace width="0.1667em"></mspace><mi>x</mi   |
|     <mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mspace width="0.1667em"></mspace><msup><mi   |
