Usage -- ways to use a function in a documentation node
*******************************************************

  * Usage: 
        document { ... , Usage => "usage", ... }

Description
===========

The Usage entry should give a formal example showing the usage of the function.
The variables used in this formal example should be the ones used in the *note
Inputs: Inputs, and *note Outputs: Outputs, sections of the documentation. Here
is the code for the Usage entry of the method *note matrix(List):
matrix_lpList_rp,:

+-------------------+
|Usage => "matrix v"|
+-------------------+

Here is the code for the Usage entry of the method *note resolution(Module):
(OldChainComplexes)resolution_lpModule_rp,:

+------------------------------+
|Usage => "resolution M\nres M"|
+------------------------------+

This option also can be used within a *note SYNOPSIS: SYNOPSIS, section.

See also
========

  * *note Inputs: Inputs, -- inputs for a function in a documentation node
  * *note Outputs: Outputs, -- outputs for a function in a documentation node

