taskResult(Task) -- retrieve the value returned by a task
*********************************************************

  * Function: *note taskResult: taskResult_lpTask_rp,
  * Usage: 
        taskResult t
  * Inputs:
      * t, a *note task: Task,, 
  * Outputs:
      * the value returned by the function provided to *note
        schedule(Function): schedule, when the task was started. *note
        taskResult(Task): taskResult_lpTask_rp, will first wait for the task to
        finish if necessary.  If the task is cancelled, an error will be
        signaled.
  * Consequences:
      * The field in t where the return value is stored is set to *note null:
        null,, and the task is considered to have completely terminated.
        Attempting to fetch the return value a second time will signal an
        error.

