printing to a file -- print to a file
*************************************

  * Usage: 
        f << x
        << x
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note file: File,, a *note string: String,, or *note null: null,
      * x
  * Outputs:
      * the output file(s) used, a *note file: File,
  * Consequences:
      * The object x is prepared for printing (with *note net: net,) and
        printed on the output file(s) f. If f is a string, then it is
        interpreted as a filename and an output file is opened, used, and
        returned, unless a single open file with the same name already exists,
        in which case it is used and returned. Filenames starting with ! or
        with $ are treated specially, see *note openInOut: openInOut,. If f is
        a list, then the output operation is performed on each one. If f is
        *note null: null,, then the output is discarded; thus *note null: null,
        is useful as a dummy output file. If f is omitted, as in the second
        usage line, then the output is sent to *note stdio: stdio,, and it will
        appear (usually) on the screen.

Parsing of *note <<: <<, associates leftward, so that several objects  may be
displayed with an expression such as f<<x<<y<<z.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : stderr << "-- hi there --" << endl                                      |
|-- hi there --                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = stderr                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : File                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : << "-- ho there --" << endl                                             |
|-- ho there --                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = stdio                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : File                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : fn = temporaryFileName()                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = /tmp/M2-31935-0/0                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : fn << "hi there" << endl << close                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = /tmp/M2-31935-0/0                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : File                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : get fn                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = hi there                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : R = QQ[x]                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : f = (x+1)^10                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|      10      9      8       7       6       5       4       3      2        |
|o7 = x   + 10x  + 45x  + 120x  + 210x  + 252x  + 210x  + 120x  + 45x  + 10x +|
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     1                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : << f                                                                    |
| 10      9      8       7       6       5       4       3      2             |
|x   + 10x  + 45x  + 120x  + 210x  + 252x  + 210x  + 120x  + 45x  + 10x + 1   |
|o8 = stdio                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : File                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : fn << f << close                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = /tmp/M2-31935-0/0                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : File                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : get fn                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o10 =  10      9      8       7       6       5       4       3      2       |
|      x   + 10x  + 45x  + 120x  + 210x  + 252x  + 210x  + 120x  + 45x  + 10x |
|      + 1                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : fn << toExternalString f << close                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o11 = /tmp/M2-31935-0/0                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o11 : File                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : get fn                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o12 = x^10+10*x^9+45*x^8+120*x^7+210*x^6+252*x^5+210*x^4+120*x^3+45*x^2+10*x+|
|      1                                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : value get fn                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|       10      9      8       7       6       5       4       3      2       |
|o13 = x   + 10x  + 45x  + 120x  + 210x  + 252x  + 210x  + 120x  + 45x  + 10x |
|      -----------------------------------------------------------------------|
|      + 1                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o13 : R                                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i14 : removeFile fn                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

