stdio -- the standard input output file
***************************************

  * Usage: 
        stdio
  * Outputs:
      * the standard input output file

Description
===========

Use this file to get input from the terminal, or to display information on the
user's screen.  This is the file always used by *note print: print, and *note
<<: <<, if it is not explicitly given a file.

+--------------------------+
|i1 : << "hi" << endl      |
|hi                        |
|                          |
|o1 = stdio                |
|                          |
|o1 : File                 |
+--------------------------+
|i2 : stdio << "hi" << endl|
|hi                        |
|                          |
|o2 = stdio                |
|                          |
|o2 : File                 |
+--------------------------+

