fileTime -- get or set file modified time
*****************************************

  * Usage: 
        fileTime s  or  fileTime(t,s)
  * Inputs:
      * t, an *note integer: ZZ,, if present, the file-modified-time will be
        set to this value
      * s, a *note string: String,, the name of a file
  * Outputs:
      * an *note integer: ZZ,, the last modified date of the file with name s
  * Consequences:
      * fileTime(t,s) sets the last modified time for the file s to t, and
        returns null if no error occurs

Description
===========

The value is the number of seconds since 00:00:00 1970-01-01 UTC, the beginning
of the epoch, so the number of seconds ago a file or directory was modified may
be found by using the following code.
+---------------------------------+
|i1 : currentTime() - fileTime "."|
|                                 |
|o1 = 75                          |
+---------------------------------+

See also
