Program << Thing -- run program with input redirection
******************************************************

  * Operator: *note <<: <<,
  * Usage: 
        prog << x
  * Inputs:
      * prog, an instance of the type *note Program: Program,, 
      * x, a *note thing: Thing,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note ProgramRun: ProgramRun,, 

Description
===========

Write x to a temporary file and run prog with this file as input using input
redirection (the < operator in a POSIX shell).

+---------------------------------------+
