loadedFiles
***********

Description
===========

After each source file is successfully loaded, the full path to the file is
stored in the hash table *note loadedFiles: loadedFiles,.  It is stored as the
value, with the corresponding key being a small integer, consecutively
assigned, starting at 0.

+--------------------------------+
|i1 : loadedFiles#0              |
|                                |
|o1 = /usr/local/share/Macaulay2/|
|     Core/version.m2            |
+--------------------------------+
|i2 : #loadedFiles               |
|                                |
|o2 = 1516                       |
+--------------------------------+

