Print -- top level method for printing results
**********************************************

  * Usage: 
        X#{topLevelMode,Print} = f
  * Inputs:
      * X, a *note type: Type,
      * f, a *note function: Function,,  that can print something of type X
  * Consequences:
      * at top level, whenever it is time to print an output value of type X,
        the function f will be called

Description
===========

The function f is responsible for printing the output prompt and for applying
the *note BeforePrint: BeforePrint, and *note AfterPrint: AfterPrint, methods,
if desired.
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : code Thing#{Standard,Print}                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = /usr/local/share/Macaulay2/Core/robust.m2:132:25-148:6: --source        |
|     code:                                                                   |
|     Thing#{Standard,Print} = x -> (                                         |
|          oprompt := concatenate(interpreterDepth:"o", toString lineNumber, "|
|          save := printWidth;                                                |
|          if printWidth != 0 then printWidth = printWidth - #oprompt;        |
|          z := robustNet x;                                                  |
|          wrapper := lookup(global Wrap,class x);                            |
|          if wrapper =!= null then (                                         |
|               fun := () -> z = wrapper z;                                   |
|               try timelimit(printingTimeLimit, fun)                         |
|               else (                                                        |
|                    alarm 0;                                                 |
|                    global debugError <- fun;                                |
|                    stderr << "--error or time limit reached in applying Wrap|
|               );                                                            |
|          << endl << oprompt << z << endl;                                   |
|          printWidth = save;                                                 |
|          )                                                                  |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|= ");                                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|method to output; type 'debugError()' to see it" << endl << endl);           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
* Menu:

* Wrap::                        a key for methods for wrapping printed output

