exit -- exit the program
************************

Description
===========

exit n -- terminates the program and returns n as return code.
exit -- terminates the program and returns 0 as return code.


Files are flushed and closed.  Functions registered with *note addEndFunction:
addEndFunction, are called, unless a nonzero return value has been provided.
Another way to exit is to type the end of file character, which is typically
set to Control-D in unix systems, and is Control-Z under Windows.

