isFinite -- whether a number is finite
**************************************

  * Usage: 
        isFinite x
  * Inputs:
      * x, a *note number: Number,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: Boolean,, whether x is finite, i.e., is not an
        infinite real number, nor not a number.

Description
===========

+-------------------------+
|i1 : sqrt 2.             |
|                         |
|o1 = 1.414213562373095   |
|                         |
|o1 : RR (of precision 53)|
+-------------------------+
|i2 : isFinite oo         |
|                         |
|o2 = true                |
+-------------------------+
|i3 : i = 1/0.            |
|                         |
|o3 = infinity            |
|                         |
|o3 : RR (of precision 53)|
+-------------------------+
|i4 : isFinite oo         |
|                         |
|o4 = false               |
+-------------------------+
|i5 : i-i                 |
|                         |
|o5 = NotANumber          |
|                         |
|o5 : RR (of precision 53)|
+-------------------------+
|i6 : isFinite oo         |
|                         |
|o6 = false               |
+-------------------------+

