  * *note AtomicInt ^^= ZZ: AtomicInt ^^= ZZ, -- atomic fetch and bitwise xor
  * *note AtomicInt |= ZZ: AtomicInt |= ZZ, -- atomic fetch and bitwise or
  * "compareExchange(AtomicInt,ZZ,ZZ)" -- see *note compareExchange:
    compareExchange, -- compare and possibly exchange the value of an atomic
    integer
  * "exchange(AtomicInt,ZZ)" -- see *note exchange: exchange, -- exchange the
    value of an atomic integer
