lock -- lock a mutex
********************

  * Usage: 
        lock m
  * Inputs:
      * m, a *note mutex: Mutex,, 

Description
===========

Locks a mutex.

+------------------+
|i1 : m = new Mutex|
|                  |
|o1 = m            |
|                  |
|o1 : Mutex        |
+------------------+
|i2 : lock m       |
+------------------+

If the mutex is already locked, then the thread blocks until it is unlocked.
This is not interruptible.

