*note GlobalAssignHook: GlobalAssignHook, so that certain types of things, when
assigned to a global variable, will acquire the name of the global variable as
their name.  The companion function *note globalReleaseFunction:
globalReleaseFunction, is used to release the name when the global variable
gets reassigned.


Another thing done by this function is to apply *note use: use, to the thing.
This is used for polynomial rings to assign values to the symbols representing
the variables (indeterminates) in the ring.


