|                                                          |
|o1 : FunctionClosure                                      |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : a=4.5                                                |
|                                                          |
|o2 = 4.5                                                  |
|                                                          |
|o2 : RR (of precision 53)                                 |
