    group of a ring or monoid
  * "degreeLength(Monoid)" -- see *note degreeLength: degreeLength, -- the
    length of the degree vector
  * "degrees(Monoid)" -- see *note degrees(Ring): degrees_lpRing_rp, -- degrees
    of generators
  * "degreesMonoid(Monoid)" -- see *note degreesRing: degreesRing, -- the ring
    or monoid of degrees
  * "degreesRing(Monoid)" -- see *note degreesRing: degreesRing, -- the ring or
