vars(Monoid) -- list of variables in a monoid
*********************************************

  * Function: *note vars: vars,
  * Usage: 
        vars M
  * Inputs:
      * R, a *note monoid: Monoid,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: List,, a list of the generators of M

Description
===========

The result is the same as that provided by *note generators(Monoid):
generators_lpMonoid_rp,.
+-------------------------+
|i1 : M = monoid[x,y,z]   |
|                         |
|o1 = M                   |
|                         |
|o1 : GeneralOrderedMonoid|
+-------------------------+
|i2 : vars M              |
|                         |
|o2 = {x, y, z}           |
|                         |
|o2 : List                |
+-------------------------+

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note vars(Monoid): vars_lpMonoid_rp, -- list of variables in a monoid
