Ring -- the class of all rings
******************************

Description
===========

Common ways to make a ring:
  * *note Ring / Ideal: Ring / Ideal, -- make a quotient ring
  * *note Ring Array: Ring Array, -- the standard way to make a polynomial ring
  * *note GF: GF, -- make a finite field
Common functions for accessing the variables or elements in a ring:
  * *note use(Ring): use_lpRing_rp, -- install ring variables and ring
    operations
  * *note generators(Ring): generators_lpRing_rp, -- the list of generators of
    a ring
  * *note numgens(Ring): numgens_lpRing_rp, -- number of generators of a
    polynomial ring
  * *note Ring _ ZZ: get a ring variable by index, -- get a ring variable by
    index
Common ways to get information about a ring:
  * *note char(Ring): char, -- get the characteristic of the ring or field
  * *note coefficientRing(Ring): coefficientRing, -- get the coefficient ring
  * *note dim(Ring): dim_lpRing_rp, -- compute the Krull dimension
Common ways to use a ring:
  * *note Ring ^ ZZ: Ring ^ ZZ, -- make a free module
  * *note Ring ^ List: Ring ^ List, -- make a free module
  * *note vars(Ring): vars_lpRing_rp, -- row matrix of the variables

