baseRings -- store the list of base rings of a ring
***************************************************

Description
===========

baseRings -- a symbol used as a key in a ring R under which is stored a list of
base rings for R.

A base ring A of R is one of the rings involved in the construction of R.

The base rings are presented in chronological order.

