========================

  * *note Module: Module, -- the class of all modules

Methods that use an immutable type:
===================================

  * "ofClass(ImmutableType)" -- see *note ofClass: ofClass, -- English phrases
    for types

For the programmer
==================

The object *note ImmutableType: ImmutableType, is a *note type: Type,, with
ancestor classes *note HashTable: HashTable, < *note Thing: Thing,.

