Function @@ Function -- composition of functions
************************************************

  * Operator: *note @@: @@,
  * Usage: 
        f @@ g
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note function: Function,
      * g, a *note function: Function,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note function: Function,, the composite function of f and g.

Description
===========

+------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : f = i -> i+1                               |
|                                                |
|o1 = f                                          |
|                                                |
|o1 : FunctionClosure                            |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : g = i -> i^2                               |
|                                                |
|o2 = g                                          |
|                                                |
|o2 : FunctionClosure                            |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : apply(0 .. 10, f @@ g)                     |
|                                                |
|o3 = (1, 2, 5, 10, 17, 26, 37, 50, 65, 82, 101) |
|                                                |
|o3 : Sequence                                   |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : apply(0 .. 10, g @@ f)                     |
|                                                |
|o4 = (1, 4, 9, 16, 25, 36, 49, 64, 81, 100, 121)|
|                                                |
|o4 : Sequence                                   |
+------------------------------------------------+

