packages provided with Macaulay2
********************************

Here is a list of the packages that are distributed with Macaulay2. The ones
that have been refereed and published are marked with a star.

Algebraic Geometry
==================

  * *note Cremona: (Cremona)Top, a gold star -- rational maps between
    projective varieties
  * *note HyperplaneArrangements: (HyperplaneArrangements)Top, -- manipulating
    finite sets of hyperplanes
  * *note IncidenceCorrespondenceCohomology:
    (IncidenceCorrespondenceCohomology)Top, -- Cohomology on the incidence
    correspondence, bundle of principal parts, and Lefschetz properties
  * *note Jets: (Jets)Top, a gold star -- compute jets of various algebraic,
    geometric and combinatorial objects
  * *note K3Surfaces: (K3Surfaces)Top, -- Explicit constructions of K3 surfaces
  * *note NumericalSemigroups: (NumericalSemigroups)Top, -- Compute the Apery
    set and invariants of a numerical semigroup ring
  * *note PencilsOfQuadrics: (PencilsOfQuadrics)Top, -- Clifford Algebra of a
    pencil of quadratic forms
  * *note SpecialFanoFourfolds: (SpecialFanoFourfolds)Top, a gold star --
    Hodge-special fourfolds
  * *note Varieties: (Varieties)Top, -- routines for working with affine and
    projective varieties and coherent sheaves on them
  * *note WhitneyStratifications: (WhitneyStratifications)Top, -- Compute
    Whitney Stratifications

