  * *note Optional inputs: using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Variables: monoid_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmVariables=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, => a
        *note list: List,, default value null, see *note
        monoid(...,Variables=>...):
        monoid_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmVariables=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,;
      * *note VariableBaseName: monoid_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmVariables=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,
