        List,, default value null, see *note monoid(...,Heft=>...):
        monoid_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmHeft=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,;
      * *note Join: monoid_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmJoin=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, => a *note Boolean
        value: Boolean,, default value null, see *note monoid(...,Join=>...):
