    tensor_lpMonoid_cmMonoid_rp, -- tensor product of monoids

Further information
===================

  * Default value: 32
  * Function: *note monoid: monoid, -- make or retrieve a monoid
  * Option key: *note MonomialSize: MonomialSize, -- an optional argument
