GLex -- graded lexicographic ordering
*************************************

Description
===========

The option GLex => n is a shortcut for Weights => n:1, Lex=>n in creating a
*note monomial ordering: monomial orderings,
+-------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a..d,MonomialOrder=>GLex]|
|                                     |
|o1 = R                               |
|                                     |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                  |
+-------------------------------------+
|i2 : a^3*b+a^4+b^100                 |
|                                     |
|      100    4    3                  |
|o2 = b    + a  + a b                 |
|                                     |
|o2 : R                               |
+-------------------------------------+

