isQuotientRing -- whether something is a quotient ring
******************************************************

  * Usage: 
        isQuotientRing R
  * Inputs:
      * R, a *note ring: Ring,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: Boolean,, *note true: true, if R is a *note
        quotient ring: QuotientRing, and *note false: false, otherwise

Description
===========

+-----------------------------------+
|i1 : S = ZZ/3[x,y,z];              |
+-----------------------------------+
|i2 : isQuotientRing S              |
|                                   |
|o2 = false                         |
+-----------------------------------+
|i3 : R = S/(x^2-y*z);              |
+-----------------------------------+
|i4 : isQuotientRing R              |
|                                   |
|o4 = true                          |
+-----------------------------------+
|i5 : ambient R                     |
|                                   |
|o5 = S                             |
|                                   |
|o5 : PolynomialRing                |
+-----------------------------------+
|i6 : symAlg = symmetricAlgebra R^2;|
+-----------------------------------+
|i7 : isQuotientRing symAlg         |
|                                   |
|o7 = false                         |
+-----------------------------------+
|i8 : sing = singularLocus R;       |
+-----------------------------------+
|i9 : isQuotientRing sing           |
|                                   |
|o9 = true                          |
+-----------------------------------+

See also
========

