monomials -- matrix of monomials in a ring element or matrix
************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        monomials f
  * Inputs:
      * f, either a *note Matrix: Matrix, or a *note RingElement: RingElement,
  * *note Optional inputs: using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Variables: monomials_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmVariables=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, =>
        ..., default value null, specify variables
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: Matrix,, a one row matrix in the same ring with all of
        the monomials that appear in f

Description
===========

Each monomial only appears once, and the monomials are sorted in what order?
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ[a..d,x,y];                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : m = matrix{{a*x^2+b*x*y+c*y^2, a*x^3+b*x^2*y+c*x*y^2+d*y^3+a*x^2}}|
|                                                                       |
|o2 = | ax2+bxy+cy2 ax3+bx2y+cxy2+dy3+ax2 |                             |
|                                                                       |
|             1      2                                                  |
|o2 : Matrix R  <-- R                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : monomials m                                                       |
|                                                                       |
|o3 = | ax3 bx2y cxy2 dy3 ax2 bxy cy2 |                                 |
|                                                                       |
|             1      7                                                  |
|o3 : Matrix R  <-- R                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
If the monomials in only some of the variables are desired, use the optional
argument *note monomials(...,Variables=>...):
monomials_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmVariables=>_pd_pd_pd_rp,.
+-----------------------------------+
|i4 : monomials(m, Variables=>{x,y})|
|                                   |
|o4 = | x3 x2y xy2 y3 x2 xy y2 |    |
|                                   |
|             1      7              |
|o4 : Matrix R  <-- R               |
+-----------------------------------+

See also
========

