coefficient -- coefficient of a monomial
****************************************

  * Usage: 
        coefficient(m,f)
  * Inputs:
      * m, a *note ring element: RingElement,, a monomial
      * f, a *note ring element: RingElement,, in the same ring R as m
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring element: RingElement,, the coefficient of the monomial m
        in f as an element of the coefficient ring of R

Description
===========

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = GF(25,Variable=>a)[x,y,z];                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = ((a+1)*x+a*y+a^2*z)^2                                               |
|                                                                             |
|                2                          2                                 |
|o2 = (- 2a - 1)x  + (- a + 1)x*y + (a - 2)y  + 2x*z + (- 2a + 1)y*z + (2a +  |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|        2                                                                    |
|     2)z                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : coefficient(y^2,f)                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = a - 2                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : GF 25                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
The returned value is an element of the coefficient ring, even in the case when
that ring is another polynomial ring.
+-------------------------------+
|i4 : S = R[r,s,t];             |
+-------------------------------+
|i5 : coefficient(r,a*x*(r+a*s))|
|                               |
|o5 = a*x                       |
|                               |
|o5 : R                         |
+-------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note coefficients: coefficients, -- get the monomials and coefficients of
    a polynomial or matrix
  * *note monomials: monomials, -- matrix of monomials in a ring element or
    matrix
  * *note coefficientRing: coefficientRing, -- get the coefficient ring

