|i3 : content(4*x + 6*x^5, x)|
|                            |
|o3 = ideal (6, 4)           |
|                            |
|o3 : Ideal of R             |
+----------------------------+
|i4 : content(4*x + 6*x^5, y)|
|                            |
|             5              |
|o4 = ideal(6x  + 4x)        |
|                            |
|o4 : Ideal of R             |
+----------------------------+
|i5 : generator oo           |
|                            |
|       5                    |
|o5 = 6x  + 4x               |
|                            |
|o5 : R                      |
+----------------------------+

