someTerms -- select some terms of a polynomial
**********************************************

  * Usage: 
        someTerms(f,i,n)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note ring element: RingElement,, in a polynomial ring
      * i, an *note integer: ZZ,, the starting index
      * n, an *note integer: ZZ,, the number of terms to select
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring element: RingElement,, the n terms of the polynomial f
        starting with the i-th one

Description
===========

The index i is 0-based, and a negative number refers to location from the end
of the polynomial.
+------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ[a..d];                        |
+------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = (a+2*b-3)^2                      |
|                                          |
|      2            2                      |
|o2 = a  + 4a*b + 4b  - 6a - 12b + 9       |
|                                          |
|o2 : R                                    |
+------------------------------------------+
|i3 : someTerms(f,0,1) -- the lead term    |
|                                          |
|      2                                   |
|o3 = a                                    |
|                                          |
|o3 : R                                    |
+------------------------------------------+
|i4 : someTerms(f,-1,1) -- the last term   |
|                                          |
|o4 = 9                                    |
|                                          |
|o4 : R                                    |
+------------------------------------------+
|i5 : someTerms(f,-2,2) -- the last 2 terms|
|                                          |
|o5 = - 12b + 9                            |
|                                          |
|o5 : R                                    |
+------------------------------------------+
Here is an example where the coefficient ring is also a polynomial ring.
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : S = R[x,y,z];                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : f = (x*(a-b)+y^2+a-1)^2                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|      4               2     2           2  2            2      2             |
|o7 = y  + (2a - 2b)x*y  + (a  - 2a*b + b )x  + (2a - 2)y  + (2a  - 2a*b - 2a |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|               2                                                             |
|     + 2b)x + a  - 2a + 1                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : S                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : someTerms(f,-1,1) -- the last term                                      |
|                                                                             |
|      2                                                                      |
|o8 = a  - 2a + 1                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : S                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : someTerms(f,-2,2) -- the last 2 terms                                   |
|                                                                             |
|        2                       2                                            |
|o9 = (2a  - 2a*b - 2a + 2b)x + a  - 2a + 1                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : S                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note monomials: monomials, -- matrix of monomials in a ring element or
    matrix
  * *note coefficients: coefficients, -- get the monomials and coefficients of
    a polynomial or matrix
  * *note terms: terms, -- provide a list of terms of a polynomial
  * *note leadTerm: leadTerm, -- get the greatest term

Ways to use someTerms:
======================

  * "someTerms(RingElement,ZZ,ZZ)"

For the programmer
==================

The object *note someTerms: someTerms, is a *note method function:
MethodFunction,.

