leadCoefficient -- the coefficient of the leading term
******************************************************

  * Usage: 
        leadCoefficient f
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note ring element: RingElement,, a polynomial
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring element: RingElement,, an element of the *note
        coefficientRing: coefficientRing, of the ring of f

Description
===========

The leading term is with respect to the monomial ordering in the ring. See
*note monomial orderings: monomial orderings, for details.

+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/5[a,b,c]; f = a*b^2 + 3*b*c^3 + 2;                     |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : leadCoefficient f                                             |
|                                                                   |
|o3 = -2                                                            |
|                                                                   |
|     ZZ                                                            |
|o3 : --                                                            |
|      5                                                            |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : S = ZZ/5[a,b,c, MonomialOrder => Lex]; g = a*b^2 +3*b*c^3 + 2;|
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : leadCoefficient g                                             |
|                                                                   |
|o6 = 1                                                             |
|                                                                   |
|     ZZ                                                            |
|o6 : --                                                            |
|      5                                                            |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note coefficients: coefficients, -- get the monomials and coefficients of
    a polynomial or matrix
  * *note coefficientRing: coefficientRing, -- get the coefficient ring
  * *note leadComponent: leadComponent, -- the leading component(s) of a vector
    or matrix
  * *note leadMonomial: leadMonomial, -- the leading monomial of a ring element
  * *note leadTerm: leadTerm, -- get the greatest term
  * *note someTerms: someTerms, -- select some terms of a polynomial
  * *note terms: terms, -- provide a list of terms of a polynomial

Ways to use leadCoefficient:
============================

  * "leadCoefficient(RingElement)"

