RingElement Sequence -- evaluation of polynomials
*************************************************

  * Operator: *note SPACE: SPACE,
  * Usage: 
        f(a,b,c)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note ring element: RingElement,, 
      * (a,b,c), a sequence of numbers or ring elements
  * Outputs:
      * r, a *note ring element: RingElement,, the result of evaluating f at
        the provided values

Description
===========

+---------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,z];        |
+---------------------------+
|i2 : f = x^3 - y^2 + 999*z;|
+---------------------------+
|i3 : f(10,0,0)             |
|                           |
|o3 = 1000                  |
|                           |
|o3 : QQ                    |
+---------------------------+
|i4 : f(0,1,0)              |
|                           |
|o4 = -1                    |
|                           |
|o4 : QQ                    |
+---------------------------+
|i5 : f(0,0,1)              |
|                           |
|o5 = 999                   |
|                           |
|o5 : QQ                    |
+---------------------------+
|i6 : f(10,1,-1)            |
|                           |
|o6 = 0                     |
|                           |
|o6 : QQ                    |
+---------------------------+
|i7 : x^3 * f(0,0,1)        |
|                           |
|         3                 |
|o7 = 999x                  |
|                           |
|o7 : R                     |
+---------------------------+
|i8 : f(0,0,x+y+z) / 999    |
|                           |
|o8 = x + y + z             |
|                           |
|o8 : R                     |
+---------------------------+
|i9 : f(z,y,x)              |
|                           |
|      3    2               |
|o9 = z  - y  + 999x        |
|                           |
|o9 : R                     |
+---------------------------+
|i10 : f(x,x,x)             |
|                           |
|       3    2              |
|o10 = x  - x  + 999x       |
|                           |
|o10 : R                    |
+---------------------------+

Note that giving fewer variables results in partial evaluation.

+------------------------+
|i11 : f(10)             |
|                        |
|         2              |
|o11 = - y  + 999z + 1000|
|                        |
|o11 : R                 |
+------------------------+
|i12 : f(10,y,z)         |
|                        |
|         2              |
|o12 = - y  + 999z + 1000|
|                        |
|o12 : R                 |
+------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note RingMap RingElement: RingMap RingElement, -- apply a ring map

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * "RingElement Number"
  * "RingElement RingElement"
  * *note RingElement Sequence: RingElement Sequence, -- evaluation of
    polynomials
