liftable -- whether lifting to another ring is possible
*******************************************************

  * Usage: 
        liftable(f,R)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note ring element: RingElement, or a *note matrix: Matrix,
      * R, a *note ring: Ring,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: Boolean,, whether f can be lifted to the ring R

Description
===========

The ring R should be one of the base rings associated with the ring of f.
+-----------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ[x]                     |
|                                   |
|o1 = R                             |
|                                   |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                |
+-----------------------------------+
|i2 : liftable ((x-1)*(x+1)-x^2, ZZ)|
|                                   |
|o2 = true                          |
+-----------------------------------+
+-------------------------+
|i3 : liftable(3/4,ZZ)    |
|                         |
|o3 = false               |
+-------------------------+
|i4 : liftable((3/4)*4,ZZ)|
|                         |
|o4 = true                |
+-------------------------+

