|i4 : monomialSubideal I                   |
|                                          |
|                     3   2      2   3   3 |
|o4 = monomialIdeal (a , a b, a*b , b , c )|
|                                          |
|o4 : MonomialIdeal of R                   |
+------------------------------------------+
If the coefficient ring is ZZ, lead coefficients of the monomials are ignored.
+---------------------------------+
|i5 : R = ZZ[x,y]                 |
|                                 |
