    monomial ideal
  * *note monomialIdeal: monomialIdeal, -- make a monomial ideal
  * *note radical: (MinimalPrimes)radical, -- the radical of an ideal
  * *note substitution and maps between rings: substitution and maps between
    rings,
  * *note working with multiple rings: working with multiple rings,

