isSquareFree -- whether something is square free monomial ideal
***************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        isSquareFree I
  * Inputs:
      * I, a *note monomial ideal: MonomialIdeal,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: Boolean,, *note true: true, if I is a square
        free *note monomial ideal: MonomialIdeal, and *note false: false,
        otherwise

Description
===========

A square free *note monomial ideal: MonomialIdeal, is an ideal generated by
products of variables; in other words, a radical monomial ideal.
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : QQ[x,y,z];                                                          |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : J = monomialIdeal(x^3*y^5*z, y^5*z^4, y^3*z^5,                      |
|               x*y*z^5, x^2*z^5, x^4*z^3, x^4*y^2*z^2,                   |
|               x^4*y^4*z)                                                |
|                                                                         |
|                     4 4    3 5    4 2 2   4 3   5 4   2 5       5   3 5 |
|o2 = monomialIdeal (x y z, x y z, x y z , x z , y z , x z , x*y*z , y z )|
|                                                                         |
|o2 : MonomialIdeal of QQ[x..z]                                           |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : isSquareFree J                                                      |
|                                                                         |
|o3 = false                                                               |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : radical J                                                           |
|                                                                         |
|o4 = monomialIdeal (x*z, y*z)                                            |
|                                                                         |
|o4 : MonomialIdeal of QQ[x..z]                                           |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : isSquareFree radical J                                              |
|                                                                         |
|o5 = true                                                                |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
Square free monomial ideals correspond both to simplicial complexes and to
unions of coordinate subspaces.
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : needsPackage "SimplicialComplexes"             |
|                                                    |
|o6 = SimplicialComplexes                            |
|                                                    |
|o6 : Package                                        |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : R = QQ[a..d]                                   |
|                                                    |
|o7 = R                                              |
|                                                    |
|o7 : PolynomialRing                                 |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : D = simplicialComplex {a*b*c,a*b*d,a*c*d,b*c*d}|
|                                                    |
|o8 = simplicialComplex | bcd acd abd abc |          |
|                                                    |
|o8 : SimplicialComplex                              |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : I = monomialIdeal D                            |
|                                                    |
|o9 = monomialIdeal(a*b*c*d)                         |
|                                                    |
|o9 : MonomialIdeal of R                             |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : isSquareFree I                                |
|                                                    |
|o10 = true                                          |
+----------------------------------------------------+


Implemented by Greg Smith.

