ideal(Matrix) -- make an ideal
******************************

  * Function: *note ideal: ideal,
  * Usage: 
        ideal M
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note matrix: Matrix,, whose *note entries: entries, are *note
        ring elements: RingElement,
  * Outputs:
      * an *note ideal: Ideal,, which is generated by all the entries in M

Description
===========

+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/7[w,x,y,z];                                                   |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = vars R                                                           |
|                                                                          |
|o2 = | w x y z |                                                          |
|                                                                          |
|             1      4                                                     |
|o2 : Matrix R  <-- R                                                      |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : ideal f                                                              |
|                                                                          |
|o3 = ideal (w, x, y, z)                                                   |
|                                                                          |
|o3 : Ideal of R                                                           |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : g = matrix{{x^2-w*y, x*y-w*z, x*z-y^2},{y^2-x*z,x^2*y-z^2,x^3-y*z}}  |
|                                                                          |
|o4 = | x2-wy xy-wz  -y2+xz |                                              |
|     | y2-xz x2y-z2 x3-yz  |                                              |
|                                                                          |
|             2      3                                                     |
|o4 : Matrix R  <-- R                                                      |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : ideal g                                                              |
|                                                                          |
|             2         2                    2     2     2         3       |
|o5 = ideal (x  - w*y, y  - x*z, x*y - w*z, x y - z , - y  + x*z, x  - y*z)|
|                                                                          |
|o5 : Ideal of R                                                           |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+


