|i4 : ideal image f                                        |
|                                                          |
|             2                      2                     |
|o4 = ideal (x  - w*y, x*y - w*z, - y  + x*z)              |
|                                                          |
|o4 : Ideal of R                                           |
+----------------------------------------------------------+

