matrices
********

An overview
===========

In Macaulay2, each matrix is defined over a ring, (see *note rings: rings,).
Matrices are perhaps the most common data type in Macaulay2.


For additional common operations and a comprehensive list of all routines in
Macaulay2 which return or use matrices, see *note Matrix: Matrix,.
* Menu:

* Matrix::                      the class of all matrices
* matrix::                      make a matrix

