entries -- get the entries of a matrix
**************************************

  * Usage: 
        entries M
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note Matrix: Matrix, or a *note MutableMatrix: MutableMatrix,
  * Outputs:
      * a doubly nested *note List: List, of the entries of M

Description
===========

+-----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ[x,y,z];                            |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : M = matrix{{x,z,x*y},{x^2+z,y*z,1}}       |
|                                               |
|o2 = | x    z  xy |                            |
|     | x2+z yz 1  |                            |
|                                               |
|             2      3                          |
|o2 : Matrix R  <-- R                           |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i3 : entries M                                 |
|                                               |
|                     2                         |
|o3 = {{x, z, x*y}, {x  + z, y*z, 1}}           |
|                                               |
|o3 : List                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i4 : N = mutableMatrix{{x,z,x*y},{x^2+z,y*z,1}}|
|                                               |
|o4 = | x    z  xy |                            |
|     | x2+z yz 1  |                            |
|                                               |
|o4 : MutableMatrix                             |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i5 : entries N                                 |
|                                               |
|                     2                         |
|o5 = {{x, z, x*y}, {x  + z, y*z, 1}}           |
|                                               |
|o5 : List                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------+

