leadComponent -- the leading component(s) of a vector or matrix
***************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        leadComponent v
  * Inputs:
      * v, a *note vector: Vector,, or *note Matrix: Matrix,
  * Outputs:
      * an *note integer: ZZ,, or *note List: List, of integers, the largest
        index of a nonzero element of v

Description
===========

+----------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : leadComponent vector{0,0,1,0,1}                |
|                                                    |
