ambient(Matrix) -- get the map between the ambient free modules
***************************************************************

  * Function: *note ambient: ambient,
  * Usage: 
        ambient f
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note matrix: Matrix,, M --> N, where M is a free module or
        quotient of a free module F.
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: Matrix,, ambient M --> ambient N

Description
===========

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a..d];                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = map(image vars R, coker matrix{{a,b},{c,d}}, transpose              |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = {1} | a 2d |                                                            |
|     {1} | b 2c |                                                            |
|     {1} | c 0  |                                                            |
|     {1} | d 0  |                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Matrix                                                                  |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|matrix{{a,b,c,d},{d,c,b,a}})                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : target f                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = image | a b c d |                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|                             1                                               |
|o3 : R-module, submodule of R                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : source f                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = cokernel | a b |                                                        |
|              | c d |                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|                            2                                                |
|o4 : R-module, quotient of R                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : ambient f                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = | a2+b2+c2+d2 2bc+2ad |                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|             1      2                                                        |
|o5 : Matrix R  <-- R                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

