contract(Matrix,Matrix) -- contract a matrix by a matrix
********************************************************

  * Function: *note contract: contract,
  * Usage: 
        h = contract(m,n)
  * Inputs:
      * m, a *note matrix: Matrix,, a map m : F <--- P between free modules of
        ranks f and p.
      * n, a *note matrix: Matrix,, a map n : G <--- Q between free modules of
        ranks g and q.
  * Outputs:
      * h, a *note matrix: Matrix,, the contraction of n by m, a matrix with
                                                                            
        the shape h : dual F ** G <--- dual P ** Q, whose entry in the slot
                                                                           
        h            is the result of contracting n   , by m
         g*i+j,q*k+l                               j,l      i,k

Description
===========

The arguments can also be ring elements or vectors.
+-----------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ[x,y,z]                 |
|                                   |
|o1 = R                             |
|                                   |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                |
+-----------------------------------+
|i2 : f = vars R ** vars R          |
|                                   |
|o2 = | x2 xy xz xy y2 yz xz yz z2 ||
|                                   |
|             1      9              |
|o2 : Matrix R  <-- R               |
+-----------------------------------+
|i3 : contract(transpose vars R, f) |
|                                   |
|o3 = {1} | x y z y 0 0 z 0 0 |     |
|     {1} | 0 x 0 x y z 0 z 0 |     |
|     {1} | 0 0 x 0 0 y x y z |     |
|                                   |
|             3      9              |
|o3 : Matrix R  <-- R               |
+-----------------------------------+
|i4 : contract(x, f)                |
|                                   |
|o4 = | x y z y 0 0 z 0 0 |         |
|                                   |
|             1      9              |
|o4 : Matrix R  <-- R               |
+-----------------------------------+
|i5 : contract(y, f)                |
|                                   |
|o5 = | 0 x 0 x y z 0 z 0 |         |
|                                   |
|             1      9              |
|o5 : Matrix R  <-- R               |
+-----------------------------------+
|i6 : contract(z, f)                |
|                                   |
|o6 = | 0 0 x 0 0 y x y z |         |
|                                   |
|             1      9              |
|o6 : Matrix R  <-- R               |
+-----------------------------------+


This function is identical to *note diff(Matrix,Matrix):
diff_lpMatrix_cmMatrix_rp,, except that the multiplication by integers that
occurs during differentiation is omitted.


