syz(Matrix) -- compute the syzygy matrix
****************************************

  * Function: *note syz: syz,
  * Usage: 
        syz h
  * Inputs:
      * h, a *note matrix: Matrix,, a matrix
  * *note Optional inputs: using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Algorithm => ..., default value Inhomogeneous, see *note
        gb(...,Algorithm=>...): Gröbner basis algorithms,
      * BasisElementLimit => ..., default value infinity, see *note
        gb(...,BasisElementLimit=>...): gb,
      * DegreeLimit => ..., default value {}, see *note
        gb(...,DegreeLimit=>...): gb,
      * GBDegrees => ..., default value null, see *note gb(...,GBDegrees=>...):
        gb,
      * HardDegreeLimit => ..., default value null, see *note
        gb(...,HardDegreeLimit=>...): gb,
      * MaxReductionCount => an *note integer: ZZ,, default value 10, the
        maximum number of reductions of an S-pair done before requeueing it, if
        the Inhomogeneous algorithm is in use
      * PairLimit => ..., default value infinity, see *note
        gb(...,PairLimit=>...): gb,
      * StopBeforeComputation => ..., default value false, see *note
        gb(...,StopBeforeComputation=>...): gb,
      * Strategy => ..., default value {}, see *note gb(...,Strategy=>...): gb,
      * SyzygyLimit => ..., default value infinity, see *note
        gb(...,SyzygyLimit=>...): gb,
      * SyzygyRows => ..., default value infinity, see *note
        gb(...,SyzygyRows=>...): gb,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: Matrix,, the matrix of minimal or trimmed generators
        for the syzygies among the columns of h

Description
===========

+----------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a..g];                                  |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal"ab2-c3,abc-cef,ade-cfg"              |
|                                                    |
|               2    3                               |
|o2 = ideal (a*b  - c , a*b*c - c*e*f, a*d*e - c*f*g)|
|                                                    |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                     |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : syz gens I                                     |
|                                                    |
|o3 = {3} | -abc+cef 0        -ade+cfg de2f-bcfg  |  |
|     {3} | ab2-c3   -ade+cfg 0        -c2de+b2fg |  |
|     {3} | 0        abc-cef  ab2-c3   bc3-b2ef   |  |
|                                                    |
|             3      4                               |
|o3 : Matrix R  <-- R                                |
+----------------------------------------------------+

See also
