|                                             |
|o7 = | -22/9 7/9   1/3  |                    |
|     | 71/9  -23/9 -2/3 |                    |
|     | -37/9 13/9  1/3  |                    |
|                                             |
|              3       3                      |
|o7 : Matrix QQ  <-- QQ                       |
