==================================

  * "MutableMatrix * MutableMatrix" -- see *note *: _st, -- a binary operator,
    usually used for multiplication
  * "RingElement * MutableMatrix" -- see *note *: _st, -- a binary operator,
    usually used for multiplication
  * "MutableMatrix + MutableMatrix" -- see *note +: +, -- a unary or binary
    operator, usually used for addition
  * "- MutableMatrix" -- see *note -: -, -- a unary or binary operator, usually
    used for negation or subtraction
