mutableMatrix -- make a mutable matrix
**************************************

  * Usage: 
        mutableMatrix m
  * Inputs:
      * m, a *note matrix: Matrix,, a *note mutable matrix: MutableMatrix,, or
        a *note list: List,
  * *note Optional inputs: using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Dense => ..., default value true, whether the encoding of the matrix
        should be dense or not: see *note MutableMatrix: MutableMatrix,
  * Outputs:
      * a new mutable matrix whose entries are obtained from m.  If m is a
        list, it should be a doubly nested list (table) of ring elements, all
        from the same ring.

Description
===========

+---------------------------------------+
|i1 : f = mutableMatrix {{1,2,3,4}}     |
|                                       |
|o1 = | 1 2 3 4 |                       |
|                                       |
|o1 : MutableMatrix                     |
+---------------------------------------+
|i2 : f_(0,2)                           |
|                                       |
|o2 = 3                                 |
+---------------------------------------+
|i3 : f_(0,2) = 33                      |
|                                       |
|o3 = 33                                |
+---------------------------------------+
|i4 : f                                 |
|                                       |
|o4 = | 1 2 33 4 |                      |
|                                       |
|o4 : MutableMatrix                     |
+---------------------------------------+
|i5 : R = QQ[a..z]                      |
|                                       |
|o5 = R                                 |
|                                       |
|o5 : PolynomialRing                    |
+---------------------------------------+
|i6 : mutableMatrix genericMatrix(R,3,3)|
|                                       |
|o6 = | a d g |                         |
|     | b e h |                         |
|     | c f i |                         |
|                                       |
|o6 : MutableMatrix                     |
+---------------------------------------+

