    a mutable matrix filled with zeroes
  * "mutableMatrix(RingFamily,ZZ,ZZ)" -- see *note mutableMatrix(Ring,ZZ,ZZ):
    mutableMatrix_lpRing_cmZZ_cmZZ_rp, -- make a mutable matrix filled with
    zeroes

