rowRankProfile -- find the row rank profile of a mutable matrix
***************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        rowRankProfile m
  * Inputs:
      * m, a *note mutable matrix: MutableMatrix,, over *note RR: RR, or *note
        CC: CC,
