      * a *note list: List,, the lexicographically smallest list of indices of
        linearly independent rows generating the row space of m

Description
===========

+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : rowRankProfile mutableMatrix {{1,2,3}, {0,0,0.}, {3,4,5} }|
|                                                               |
|o1 = {0, 2}                                                    |
|                                                               |
|o1 : List                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+

