submatrices
***********

Here are the ways to get a submatrix of a matrix.
* Menu:

* submatrix'::                  exclude rows and/or columns of a matrix
* submatrixByDegrees::          submatrix consisting of rows and columns in an interval or box of degrees
* submatrix(Matrix,VisibleList): submatrix_lpMatrix_cmVisibleList_rp.  select columns
* submatrix(Matrix,VisibleList,VisibleList): submatrix.  select part of a matrix
* Matrix _ List: Matrix _us List.  select columns
* Matrix ^ List::               select rows
* Matrix _ Array: Matrix _us Array.  component of map corresponding to summand of source
* Matrix ^ Array::              component of map corresponding to summand of target
