  * "submatrix'(Matrix,Nothing,VisibleList)"
  * "submatrix'(Matrix,VisibleList)"
  * "submatrix'(Matrix,VisibleList,Nothing)"
  * "submatrix'(Matrix,VisibleList,VisibleList)"

