========

  * *note submatrix': submatrix', -- exclude rows and/or columns of a matrix
  * *note Matrix _ List: Matrix _us List, -- select columns
  * *note Matrix ^ List: Matrix ^ List, -- select rows
  * *note submatrix(Matrix,VisibleList): submatrix_lpMatrix_cmVisibleList_rp,
    -- select columns
  * *note Matrix _ Array: Matrix _us Array, -- component of map corresponding
    to summand of source
  * *note Matrix ^ Array: Matrix ^ Array, -- component of map corresponding to
    summand of target

