======================

  * "submatrix(Matrix,VisibleList,VisibleList)"
  * "submatrix(MutableMatrix,VisibleList,VisibleList)"
  * *note submatrix(Matrix,VisibleList): submatrix_lpMatrix_cmVisibleList_rp,
    -- select columns
  * "submatrix(MutableMatrix,VisibleList)" -- see *note
    submatrix(Matrix,VisibleList): submatrix_lpMatrix_cmVisibleList_rp, --
