Matrix ^ List -- select rows
****************************

  * Operator: *note ^: ^,
  * Usage: 
        f_rows
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note matrix: Matrix,, a matrix between free modules
      * rows, a *note list: List,, a list of integers denoting the choice of
        rows
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: Matrix,, the submatrix of f corresponding to the rows
        in the list rows.

Description
===========

This is the same as calling *note submatrix(f,rows,): submatrix,.
+---------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a..f];               |
