diff(RingElement,Matrix) -- differentiate each entry of a matrix
****************************************************************

  * Function: *note diff: diff,
  * Usage: 
        diff(x,f)
  * Inputs:
      * x, a *note ring element: RingElement,, a polynomial
      * f, a *note matrix: Matrix,, a matrix between free modules over the same
        ring as x
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: Matrix,, having the same shape as f, whose (i,j) entry
        is the result of differentiating f_(i,j) by the differential operator
        corresponding to x.

Description
===========

The shape of the resulting matrix is the same as the shape of f, but the
degrees of the source module are different in an attempt to ensure that the
result is homogeneous.
+-----------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,z];                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = matrix{{x^2-y*z, x*y*z + z^4}, {x-1, 2*y^2+z^2-1}}|
|                                                           |
|o2 = | x2-yz z4+xyz   |                                    |
|     | x-1   2y2+z2-1 |                                    |
|                                                           |
|             2      2                                      |
|o2 : Matrix R  <-- R                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : diff(x,f)                                             |
|                                                           |
|o3 = | 2x yz |                                             |
|     | 1  0  |                                             |
|                                                           |
|             2      2                                      |
|o3 : Matrix R  <-- R                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : diff(x^2-y*z,f)                                       |
|                                                           |
|o4 = | 3 -x |                                              |
|     | 0 0  |                                              |
|                                                           |
|             2      2                                      |
|o4 : Matrix R  <-- R                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note contract: contract, -- contract one matrix by another
  * *note jacobian: jacobian, -- the Jacobian matrix of partial derivatives
  * *note diff and contract: diff and contract,

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note diff(RingElement,Matrix): diff_lpRingElement_cmMatrix_rp, --
    differentiate each entry of a matrix
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

