diff(Matrix,Matrix) -- differentiate a matrix by a matrix
*********************************************************

  * Function: *note diff: diff,
  * Usage: 
        diff(m,n)
  * Inputs:
      * m, a *note matrix: Matrix,, a map m : F <--- P between free modules of
        ranks f and p.
      * n, a *note matrix: Matrix,, a map n : G <--- Q between free modules of
        ranks g and q.
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: Matrix,, with the shape h : dual F ** G <--- dual P **
                                                                              
        Q, whose entry in the slot h            is the result of
                                    g*i+j,q*k+l                 
        differentiating n    by the differential operator corresponding to
                         j,l                                              
        m   .
         i,k

Description
===========

The arguments m and n may also be vectors or ring elements.
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a,b,c][x,y,z]                            |
|                                                     |
|o1 = R                                               |
|                                                     |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : m = transpose vars R                            |
|                                                     |
|o2 = {-1, 0} | x |                                   |
|     {-1, 0} | y |                                   |
|     {-1, 0} | z |                                   |
|                                                     |
|             3      1                                |
|o2 : Matrix R  <-- R                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : n = matrix{{x^2-a*y^3, x^3-z^2*y, x*y-b, x*z-c}}|
|                                                     |
|o3 = | -ay3+x2 x3-yz2 xy-b xz-c |                    |
|                                                     |
|             1      4                                |
|o3 : Matrix R  <-- R                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : diff(m,n)                                       |
|                                                     |
|o4 = {1, 0} | 2x    3x2  y z |                       |
|     {1, 0} | -3ay2 -z2  x 0 |                       |
|     {1, 0} | 0     -2yz 0 x |                       |
|                                                     |
|             3      4                                |
|o4 : Matrix R  <-- R                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------+

