|                                       |
|o6 = | 88 0   0  0 0 |                 |
|     | 0  3.9 0  0 0 |                 |
|     | 0  0   .8 0 0 |                 |
|                                       |
|                3         5            |
|o6 : Matrix RR    <-- RR               |
|              53        53             |
