trace(Matrix) -- trace of a matrix
**********************************

  * Function: *note trace: trace_lpMatrix_rp,

Description
===========

trace f -- returns the trace of the matrix f.


+-----------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[a..d]        |
|                             |
|o1 = R                       |
|                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing          |
+-----------------------------+
|i2 : p = matrix {{a,b},{c,d}}|
|                             |
|o2 = | a b |                 |
|     | c d |                 |
|                             |
|             2      2        |
|o2 : Matrix R  <-- R         |
+-----------------------------+
|i3 : trace p                 |
|                             |
|o3 = a + d                   |
|                             |
|o3 : R                       |
+-----------------------------+

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note trace(Matrix): trace_lpMatrix_rp, -- trace of a matrix
