determinant -- determinant of a matrix
**************************************

  * Usage: 
        det M
  * Inputs:
      * M, a square *note matrix: Matrix,
  * *note Optional inputs: using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Strategy: determinant_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStrategy=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, =>
        ..., default value null, choose between Bareiss, Cofactor and Dynamic
        algorithms
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring element: RingElement,, which is the determinant of M

Description
===========

+----------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[vars(0..8)]                             |
|                                                    |
|o1 = R                                              |
|                                                    |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                 |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : M = genericMatrix(R,2,2)                       |
|                                                    |
|o2 = | a c |                                        |
|     | b d |                                        |
|                                                    |
|             2      2                               |
|o2 : Matrix R  <-- R                                |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : det M                                          |
|                                                    |
|o3 = - b*c + a*d                                    |
|                                                    |
|o3 : R                                              |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : N = genericMatrix(R,3,3)                       |
|                                                    |
|o4 = | a d g |                                      |
|     | b e h |                                      |
|     | c f i |                                      |
|                                                    |
|             3      3                               |
|o4 : Matrix R  <-- R                                |
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : det N                                          |
|                                                    |
|o5 = - c*e*g + b*f*g + c*d*h - a*f*h - b*d*i + a*e*i|
|                                                    |
|o5 : R                                              |
+----------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note exteriorPower: exteriorPower, -- exterior power
  * *note minors: minors_lpZZ_cmMatrix_rp, -- ideal generated by minors
  * *note permanents: permanents, -- ideal generated by square permanents of a
    matrix
  * *note pfaffians: pfaffians, -- ideal generated by Pfaffians
* Menu:

* determinant(...,Strategy=>...): determinant_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmStrategy=>_pd_pd_pd_rp.  choose between Bareiss, Cofactor and Dynamic algorithms
* Bareiss::
* Cofactor::
* Dynamic::

