The ring of M must be *note ZZ: ZZ,.


In the following example we construct a module with a known (but disguised)
factorization.
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : f = random(ZZ^6, ZZ^4)                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = | 8 3 8 6 |                                                             |
|     | 1 7 5 8 |                                                             |
|     | 3 8 2 6 |                                                             |
|     | 7 8 3 9 |                                                             |
|     | 8 5 6 3 |                                                             |
|     | 3 7 3 7 |                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|              6       4                                                      |
|o1 : Matrix ZZ  <-- ZZ                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : M = subquotient ( f * diagonalMatrix{2,3,8,21}, f *                     |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = subquotient (| 16 9  64 126 |, | 176 585  0 630 |)                      |
|                  | 2  21 40 168 |  | 22  1365 0 840 |                       |
|                  | 6  24 16 126 |  | 66  1560 0 630 |                       |
|                  | 14 24 24 189 |  | 154 1560 0 945 |                       |
|                  | 16 15 48 63  |  | 176 975  0 315 |                       |
|                  | 6  21 24 147 |  | 66  1365 0 735 |                       |
|                                                                             |
|                                 6                                           |
|o2 : ZZ-module, subquotient of ZZ                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|diagonalMatrix{2*11,3*5*13,0,21*5} )                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : factor M                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|          ZZ      ZZ                                                         |
|o3 = ZZ + -- + -------                                                       |
|           5   5*11*13                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Expression of class Sum                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

