Module ^ Array -- projection onto summand
*****************************************

  * Operator: *note ^: ^,
  * Usage: 
        M^[i,j,...,k]
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note module: Module,
      * [i,j,...,k], an array of indices
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: Matrix,

Description
===========


The module M should be a direct sum, and the result is the map obtained by
projection onto the sum of the components numbered or named i, j, ..., k.  Free
modules are regarded as direct sums of modules.


