  * *note directSum: directSum, -- direct sum of modules or maps
  * *note Matrix ^ Array: Matrix ^ Array, -- component of map corresponding to
    summand of target
  * *note Module ^ Array: Module ^ Array, -- projection onto summand
  * *note Module _ List: Module _us List, -- map from free module to some
    generators

Ways to use this method:
