Ring ^ ZZ -- make a free module
*******************************

  * Operator: *note ^: ^,
  * Usage: 
        R^n
  * Inputs:
      * R, a *note ring: Ring,
      * n, an *note integer: ZZ,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note module: Module,, a new free R-module of rank n.

Description
===========

The new free module has basis elements of degree zero.  To specify the degrees
explicitly, see *note Ring ^ List: Ring ^ List,.
+----------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ[x,y,z]/(x^2-y*x)|
|                            |
|o1 = R                      |
|                            |
|o1 : QuotientRing           |
+----------------------------+
|i2 : F = R^4                |
|                            |
|      4                     |
|o2 = R                      |
|                            |
|o2 : R-module, free         |
+----------------------------+
|i3 : degrees F              |
|                            |
|o3 = {{0}, {0}, {0}, {0}}   |
|                            |
|o3 : List                   |
+----------------------------+

