      * a *note Betti tally: BettiTally,, showing the zero-th, first graded,
        and total Betti numbers of $M$.

Note that the Betti numbers are not minimized.

+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i22 : S = ZZ/10007[x,y];                                       |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i23 : betti coker matrix{{x^3, x*y^2}, {y*x^2, y^3}}           |
|                                                               |
|             0 1                                               |
|o23 = total: 2 2                                               |
|          0: 2 .                                               |
|          1: . .                                               |
|          2: . 2                                               |
|                                                               |
|o23 : BettiTally                                               |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i24 : betti coker map(S^{0,-1}, , matrix{{x^2, y}, {y^3, x^2}})|
