multigraded -- convert a Betti tally into a multigraded Betti tally
*******************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        multigraded t
  * Inputs:
      * t, a *note Betti tally: BettiTally,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note multigraded Betti tally: MultigradedBettiTally,, different from
        the input only in the printed diagram

Description
===========

A multigraded Betti tally is a special type of *note BettiTally: BettiTally,
that both prints nicely and from which multigraded Betti numbers could be
easily extracted.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[a..d, Degrees => {2:{1,0},2:{0,1}}];                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal random(R^1, R^{2:{-2,-2},2:{-3,-3}});                         |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : t = betti res I                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|            0 1  2  3 4                                                      |
|o3 = total: 1 4 13 14 4                                                      |
|         0: 1 .  .  . .                                                      |
|         1: . .  .  . .                                                      |
|         2: . .  .  . .                                                      |
|         3: . 2  .  . .                                                      |
|         4: . .  .  . .                                                      |
|         5: . 2  .  . .                                                      |
|         6: . .  1  . .                                                      |
|         7: . .  8  6 .                                                      |
|         8: . .  4  8 4                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : BettiTally                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : B = multigraded t                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|         0         1                   2                   3                 |
|o4 =  0: 1         .                   .                   .                 |
|      4: . 2*a^2*b^2                   .                   .                 |
|      6: . 2*a^3*b^3                   .                   .                 |
|      8: .         .             a^4*b^4                   .                 |
|      9: .         . 4*a^5*b^4+4*a^4*b^5                   .                 |
