map(Module,Nothing,Matrix) -- recast a matrix to have a new target, and a free module as source
***********************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note map: map,
  * Usage: 
        map(M,,f)
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note module: Module,
      * f, a *note matrix: Matrix,, whose target has the same number of
