===========

+----------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/101[x,y]; |
+----------------------+
|i2 : p = matrix{{x,y}}|
|                      |
|o2 = | x y |          |
|                      |
|             1      2 |
|o2 : Matrix R  <-- R  |
