|i3 : q = map(R^{3},,p)|
|                      |
|o3 = {-3} | x y |     |
|                      |
|             1      2 |
|o3 : Matrix R  <-- R  |
+----------------------+
|i4 : degrees target q |
|                      |
|o4 = {{-3}}           |
|                      |
|o4 : List             |
+----------------------+
