==============================================

  * "basis(...,Degree=>...)" -- see *note basis: basis, -- basis or generating
    set of all or part of a ring, ideal or module
  * "cohomology(...,Degree=>...)" -- see *note cohomology: cohomology, --
    general cohomology functor
