End -- module of endomorphisms
******************************

  * Usage: 
        End M
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note ring: Ring,, an *note ideal: Ideal,, or a *note module:
        Module,,
  * *note Optional inputs: using functions with optional inputs,:
      * DegreeLimit => an *note integer: ZZ, or a *note list: List,, default
        value null, see *note Hom(...,DegreeLimit=>...): Hom,
      * MinimalGenerators => a *note Boolean value: Boolean,, default value
        true, see *note Hom(...,MinimalGenerators=>...): Hom,
      * Strategy => a *note thing: Thing,, default value null, see *note
        Hom(...,Strategy=>...): Hom,

Description
===========

Constructs the module of endomorphisms of $M$.

+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a,b,c];                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : M = coker koszul_2 vars R                          |
|                                                        |
|o2 = cokernel {1} | -b -c 0  |                          |
|              {1} | a  0  -c |                          |
|              {1} | 0  a  b  |                          |
|                                                        |
|                            3                           |
|o2 : R-module, quotient of R                            |
