Singular Book 1.2.3 -- leading data
***********************************

+------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = QQ[x,y,z,MonomialOrder=>Lex];          |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = y^4*z^3+2*x^2*y^2*z^2+3*x^5+4*z^4+5*y^2|
|                                                |
|       5     2 2 2    4 3     2     4           |
|o2 = 3x  + 2x y z  + y z  + 5y  + 4z            |
|                                                |
|o2 : A                                          |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : leadMonomial f                             |
|                                                |
|      5                                         |
|o3 = x                                          |
|                                                |
|o3 : A                                          |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : exponents leadMonomial f                   |
|                                                |
|o4 = {{5, 0, 0}}                                |
|                                                |
|o4 : List                                       |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : leadTerm f                                 |
|                                                |
|       5                                        |
|o5 = 3x                                         |
|                                                |
|o5 : A                                          |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : leadCoefficient f                          |
|                                                |
|o6 = 3                                          |
|                                                |
|o6 : QQ                                         |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : someTerms(f,1,size f - 1)                  |
|                                                |
|       2 2 2    4 3     2     4                 |
|o7 = 2x y z  + y z  + 5y  + 4z                  |
|                                                |
|o7 : A                                          |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : someTerms(f,1,-1)                          |
|                                                |
|       2 2 2    4 3     2     4                 |
|o8 = 2x y z  + y z  + 5y  + 4z                  |
|                                                |
|o8 : A                                          |
+------------------------------------------------+
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

