and we find that in the tacnodal case the gonality is still 4, while in the
triple point case the gonality is 3. Note that we could have made the
computation faster, as in the following example.  In these cases the resolution
is so fast that the speedup is not noticeable, but in larger cases it would be
worthwhile. First clear the info computed in IC1

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i46 : IC1 = matrix entries IC1                                               |
|                                                                             |
