we investigate by checking its dimension and degree

+-----------+
|i31 : dim I|
|           |
|o31 = 2    |
+-----------+

The answer ``2'' means that $I$ is the ideal of a curve in $\PP^5$, the ambient
space of the Grassmannian of lines.

+--------------+
