mod -- reduce modulo an integer
*******************************

  * Usage: 
        mod(i,n)
  * Inputs:
      * i, an *note integer: ZZ,
      * n, an *note integer: ZZ,
  * Outputs:
      * an *note integer: ZZ,, the integer i modulo n, as an element of ZZ/n.

See also
========

  * *note ZZ % ZZ: %, -- a binary operator, usually used for remainder and
    reduction

For the programmer
==================

The object *note mod: mod, is a *note function closure: FunctionClosure,.

