gbSnapshot -- the Gröbner basis matrix as so far computed
*********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        gbSnapshot M
  * Inputs:
      * M, an *note ideal: Ideal,, a *note matrix: Matrix,, or a *note module:
        Module,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: Matrix,, the Gröbner basis as so far computed

Description
===========

This routine is useful to be able to obtain partial results from a partially
computed Gröbner basis. Little computation is done (although a minimalization,
auto-reduction and sort is performed).
