gbRemove -- remove Gröbner basis
********************************

  * Usage: 
        gbRemove M
  * Inputs:
      * M, an *note ideal: Ideal,, a *note matrix: Matrix,, or a *note module:
        Module,
  * Consequences:
      * all Gröbner bases computed for M are removed

Description
===========

This is a simple way to remove the space associated with large Gröbner bases
that are no longer needed.
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ[a]/(a^2-3)[x,y]                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = y^2-x*(x-1)*(x-a)                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|        3           2    2                                                   |
|o2 = - x  + (a + 1)x  + y  - a*x                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : J = ideal(diff(x,F),diff(y,F),F)                                        |
|                                                                             |
|                2                         3           2    2                 |
|o3 = ideal (- 3x  + (2a + 2)x - a, 2y, - x  + (a + 1)x  + y  - a*x)          |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : gens gb J                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = | 12 6a+6 2y 4x-2a+6 (2a+2)x+2a+6 y2+2x-a-3 x2+3a |                     |
|                                                                             |
|             1      7                                                        |
|o4 : Matrix R  <-- R                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : peek J.generators.cache                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = CacheTable{GroebnerBasisOptions{HardDegreeLimit => null} =>             |
|                                     Syzygies => false                       |
|                                     SyzygyRows => 0                         |
|                image => image | -3x2+(2a+2)x-a 2y -x3+(a+1)x2+y2            |
|                isHomogeneous => false                                       |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|GroebnerBasis[status: done; S-pairs encountered up to degree 8]}             |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|-ax |                                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : gbRemove J                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : peek J.generators.cache                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = CacheTable{image => image | -3x2+(2a+2)x-a 2y -x3+(a+1)x2+y2-ax |}      |
|                isHomogeneous => false                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

