Caveat
======

(1) The MGB and F4 options are experimental, work only over a finite field of
char $< 2^{32}$, not over quotient rings, and not over exterior or Weyl
algebras.  However, these versions can be much faster when they apply. (2) The
experimental versions do not stash their results into the ideal or module. (3)
The experimental version only works for ideals currently.

