|i1 : R = QQ[s,t,x,y,z, MonomialOrder=>Eliminate 2];                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal(x-s^3-s*t-1, y-t^3-3*t^2-t, z-s*t^3)                          |
|                                                                             |
|               3                   3     2               3                   |
|o2 = ideal (- s  - s*t + x - 1, - t  - 3t  - t + y, - s*t  + z)              |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                                              |
