hilbertSeries(...,Reduce=>...) -- reduce the Hilbert series
***********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        hilbertSeries(..., Reduce => true)
  * Consequences:
      * the resulting rational function is reduced by cancelling factors of the
        numerator that occur explicitly as factors of the denominator. See also
        *note reduceHilbert: reduceHilbert,.

Description
===========

+-----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,z];                            |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : hilbertSeries ideal (x,y)                 |
|                                               |
|               2                               |
|     1 - 2T + T                                |
|o2 = -----------                               |
|              3                                |
|       (1 - T)                                 |
|                                               |
|o2 : Expression of class Divide                |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i3 : hilbertSeries(ideal (x,y), Reduce => true)|
|                                               |
|        1                                      |
|o3 = -------                                   |
|     (1 - T)                                   |
|                                               |
|o3 : Expression of class Divide                |
+-----------------------------------------------+

