|i5 : f = f + map(target f, source f, id_(R^2))|
|                                              |
|o5 = {-1} | 8x+y+1 8x+3y   |                  |
|     {-1} | 3x+7y  3x+7y+1 |                  |
|                                              |
|             2      2                         |
|o5 : Matrix R  <-- R                          |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i6 : remainder'(f,g)                          |
|                                              |
|o6 = {-1} | 1 0 |                             |
|     {-1} | 0 1 |                             |
|                                              |
|             2      2                         |
|o6 : Matrix R  <-- R                          |
+----------------------------------------------+

