or sequence may be installed on (symbol intersect, Type).

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : code lookup(symbol intersect, Module)                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = ../../../../../Macaulay2/m2/option.m2:15:14-18:8: --source code:        |
