|     | Module.intersect = moduleIntersectOpts >> opts -> L -> intersectHelper|
|     | -- option table opts:                                                 |
|     | OptionTable{MinimalGenerators => true}                                |
|     |             Strategy => null                                          |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|nd arguments.                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|            location of symbol                                               |
