union(Set,Set) -- set union
***************************

  * Function: *note union: union,
  * Usage: 
        x + y
  * Inputs:
      * x, a *note set: Set,
      * y, a *note set: Set,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note set: Set,, the union of x and y

Description
===========

+----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : set{a,b,c} + set{a,d,f}                  |
|                                              |
|o1 = set {c, d, f, a, b}                      |
|                                              |
|o1 : Set                                      |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : union(set{a,b,c}, set{a,d,f}, set{a,c,e})|
|                                              |
|o2 = set {c, d, e, f, a, b}                   |
|                                              |
|o2 : Set                                      |
+----------------------------------------------+

The function sum can be used to form the union of a list of sets, but this can
be slow for long lists.

+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : x = apply(3, i -> set apply(3, j -> 10*i+j))       |
|                                                        |
|o3 = {set {0, 1, 2}, set {12, 10, 11}, set {20, 21, 22}}|
|                                                        |
