Set ** Set -- Cartesian product
*******************************

  * Operator: *note **: _st_st,
  * Usage: 
        x ** y
  * Inputs:
      * x, a *note set: Set,
      * y, a *note set: Set,
  * Outputs:
      * whose elements are the sequences (a,b), where a is an element of x, and
        b is an element of y., a *note set: Set,

Description
===========

+---------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : set {1,2} ** set {a,b,c}                            |
|                                                         |
|o1 = set {(1, a), (2, a), (1, b), (2, b), (1, c), (2, c)}|
|                                                         |
|o1 : Set                                                 |
+---------------------------------------------------------+
Suppose we wish to form the set of all triples with entries either in the set A
below.
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : A = set{1,2}                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = set {1, 2}                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Set                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : A ** A ** A                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = set {((1, 1), 1), ((1, 2), 1), ((1, 1), 2), ((2, 1), 1), ((2, 2), 1),   |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     ((1, 2), 2), ((2, 1), 2), ((2, 2), 2)}                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Set                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
To make this last a set of triples, *note splice: splice, each element
together. Or, use *note VirtualTally ^** ZZ: VirtualTally ^_st_st ZZ,.
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : (A ** A ** A)/splice                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = set {(1, 1, 1), (1, 1, 2), (1, 2, 1), (2, 1, 1), (2, 1, 2), (2, 2, 1),  |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     (1, 2, 2), (2, 2, 2)}                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : Set                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : A^**3                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = set {((1, 1), 1), ((1, 2), 1), ((1, 1), 2), ((2, 1), 1), ((2, 2), 1),   |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     ((1, 2), 2), ((2, 1), 2), ((2, 2), 2)}                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : Set                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

