integrate -- numerical integration
**********************************

  * Usage: 
        integrate(f, a, b)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note function: Function,, 
      * a, a *note number: Number, or an *note infinite number:
        InfiniteNumber,,
      * b, a *note number: Number, or an *note infinite number:
        InfiniteNumber,,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note real number: RR,, 

Description
===========

Integrate f from a to b numerically, using Gaussian quadrature (see
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaussian_quadrature ).

+--------------------------+
|i1 : integrate(sin, 0, pi)|
|                          |
|o1 = 2                    |
|                          |
|o1 : RR (of precision 53) |
+--------------------------+

For half-infinite intervals, 20-point Gauss-Laguerre quadrature (see
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gauss-Laguerre_quadrature ) is used.

+-----------------------------------------+
|i2 : integrate(x -> exp(-x), 0, infinity)|
|                                         |
|o2 = .9999999999999998                   |
|                                         |
|o2 : RR (of precision 53)                |
+-----------------------------------------+

For infinite intervals, 20-point Gauss-Hermite quadrature (see
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gauss-Hermite_quadrature ) is used.

+---------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : integrate(x -> exp(-x^2), -infinity, infinity)|
|                                                   |
|o3 = 1.772453850905516                             |
|                                                   |
|o3 : RR (of precision 53)                          |
+---------------------------------------------------+

Ways to use integrate:
======================

  * "integrate(Function,InfiniteNumber,InfiniteNumber)"
  * "integrate(Function,InfiniteNumber,Number)"
  * "integrate(Function,Number,InfiniteNumber)"
  * "integrate(Function,Number,Number)"

For the programmer
==================

The object *note integrate: integrate, is a *note method function:
MethodFunction,.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The source of this document is in Macaulay2Doc/functions/integrate-doc.m2:35:0.

