          * *note SimpleDoc: (SimpleDoc)Top, -- a simple documentation function
          * *note StatePolytope: (StatePolytope)Top, -- the state polytope of
            an ideal
          * *note SymmetricPolynomials: (SymmetricPolynomials)Top, -- symmetric
            polynomials
          * *note Text: (Text)Top, -- documentation and hypertext
      * downloadable packages:
          * Kronecker, Kronecker normal form of a matrix pencil, by Edward
