Singular-Factory
****************

With the kind permission of the authors of Singular, G.-M. Greuel, R. Stobbe,
G. Pfister, H. Schoenemann, and J. Schmidt, University of Kaiserslautern,
Macaulay2 incorporates Singular-Factory, version 4.3.2, a free library of
polynomial routines that provides for factorization of polynomials.  It is part
of Singular, whose home page is https://www.singular.uni-kl.de/.


The following important routines call upon it:
  * *note factor: factor, -- factor a ring element or a ZZ-module
  * *note gcd: gcd, -- greatest common divisor
  * *note minimalPrimes: (MinimalPrimes)minimalPrimes, -- minimal primes of an
    ideal
  * *note irreducibleCharacteristicSeries: irreducibleCharacteristicSeries, --
    irreducible characteristic series of an ideal
